WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.200
Hey everyone Diavolo here and I think that to&nbsp;
start off this massive video going over every&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.880
single cursed technique inside of the verse, that&nbsp;
we firstly delve into the teachers of each school&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:13.840
and their respective techniques, then work our&nbsp;
way though the rest from there. Ofcourse not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:18.240
every person will be mentioned because sometimes&nbsp;
2 people might have the same technique and some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:23.920
sorcerers dont even have an innate or inherited&nbsp;
technique. Also for you disgusting anime only’s,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:27.986
this will include a bunch of stuff&nbsp;
from the manga. So you’ve been warned.

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:31.560
Satoru Gojo - Getting into it though and being&nbsp;
one of the strongest people inside of the verse,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:35.080
rip the strongest, Jujutsu tech’s first&nbsp;
year teacher, Satoru Gojo is equipped with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.229
a plethora of different abilities that weve&nbsp;
seen being used in variety of different ways.

00:00:40.229 --> 00:00:43.080
(Six Eyes) Firstly, putting him&nbsp;
already a mile above the rest,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:48.240
Gojo born with these bad boys. A Six Eyes&nbsp;
bearer has immense perception and unrivaled&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:53.320
visual prowess far beyond that of any other&nbsp;
sorcerer. Their eyesight is comparable to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:58.160
high-definition infrared camera and they can&nbsp;
easily see things from several kilometers away.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:02.760
At all times the Six Eyes are constantly&nbsp;
active, kinda like a passive trait your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:07.600
unable to deactivate. Weirdly and im assuming&nbsp;
because they’re a physical body part the person&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:11.960
was born with, but they dont seem to actually&nbsp;
take up any cursed energy itself. More just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:16.280
placing a physical burden on the user if the&nbsp;
eyes are uncovered for an extended period&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:20.960
of time. The Six Eye’s are without issue,&nbsp;
able to observe the flow of cursed energy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:25.160
gifting their user with the added ability to read&nbsp;
an individual's cursed technique and determine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:29.400
its function. They can even differentiate&nbsp;
between different types of cursed energy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:33.040
which in turn allows the user to&nbsp;
figure out who they might be facing.

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:37.200
The Six Eyes allow for the extremely&nbsp;
precise manipulation of cursed energy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:41.480
down to an atomic level. This not only allows&nbsp;
the bearer to operate the Limitless through&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:46.960
the complex control of cursed energy but enables&nbsp;
them to process it with great efficiency as well.

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:49.400
Speaking of limitless, next up.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:54.800
(Limitless) At the base level and just like&nbsp;
the eyes themselves, Limitless is an innate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.800 --> 00:02:00.240
technique which is passed down inside of the Gojo&nbsp;
Family. This technique grants its users an almost&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:06.320
absolute control over an un-tangible space through&nbsp;
CE manipulation. In turn, anything that approaches&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:11.000
the infinity slows down and never reaches the&nbsp;
user. This is because the technique takes the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:16.160
finite amount of space between the two subjects&nbsp;
and divides it an infinite amount of times.

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:21.040
In math's, no matter how many times you divide&nbsp;
a number, it will never reach zero. Instead,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:24.040
you're left with incredibly tiny&nbsp;
fractional parts that are almost&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:28.680
impossible to measure with our basic human&nbsp;
eyes. Now, imagine if we could bring this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:34.560
mathematical concept to life and thats how we&nbsp;
get the insanely broken ability of Limitless.

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:38.240
Due to just how brilliant and&nbsp;
in-depth of a technique that it is,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:42.447
Limitless has three standard and one&nbsp;
"non-standard" techniques beyond this.

00:02:42.447 --> 00:02:45.960
(Cursed Technique Lapse or Blue) The first of&nbsp;
these is, Cursed Technique Lapse or Blue. This&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:50.640
remarkable technique not only cranks up the&nbsp;
cursed energy output to unprecedented levels&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:55.200
but also generates the power to attract. This&nbsp;
is achieved by amplifying the Limitless and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.200 --> 00:03:01.960
bringing the conceptual impossibility of&nbsp;
negative distance into reality. This forces&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:05.680
the surrounding space to try and fill in the&nbsp;
gap by pulling violently toward the source&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:10.240
of the previously mentioned impossibility,&nbsp;
creating the magnetic-like effect. Plus I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:14.800
guess we can chuck in the Maximum Output&nbsp;
version of this technique to just pad&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:21.200
the already ridiculously long video. (Cursed&nbsp;
Technique Maximum Cursed Energy Output Blue)

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:27.320
(Cursed Technique Reversal: Red) The second&nbsp;
of the three, is the reversal of limitless.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:31.560
So unlike how blue played on the effects of&nbsp;
cursed energy, cursed technique reversal red&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:36.000
is the opposite as it reverses the effect of the&nbsp;
strengthened technique and brings the divergence&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:41.360
of infinity into reality, generating the power&nbsp;
to repel. Gojo is able to achieve his first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:45.720
use of it in his second battle against Toji&nbsp;
after he was physically pushed to his limits.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:55.000
As he said after returned, this is achieved by&nbsp;
flowing reverse cursed energy into the power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.000 --> 00:04:00.480
of the Limitless, creating a repelling effect&nbsp;
thats over 2 times stronger in comparison to blue.

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:04.520
Ofcourse the reason he failed to use Red&nbsp;
initially against that paper bag head dude,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:06.240
was because Gojo’s application&nbsp;
of RCT wasn't there yet.

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:14.080
(Reverse Curse Technique) While we are here,&nbsp;
mise aswell explain that RCT, or Reverse&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:22.280
Curse Technique, technically isn't a cursed&nbsp;
technique, but a special type of sequence&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:27.360
that takes cursed energy and reverses it into&nbsp;
positive energy. It is a very complex ability&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:32.360
and is mainly used to heal human bodies. Dont&nbsp;
ask me why its not specifically a technique,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:35.000
I just know Gege Akutami came out and&nbsp;
specifically said it at one point.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:44.000
As we learnt recently, Reverse Cursed&nbsp;
Technique also allows someone to restore&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:47.200
their exhausted Cursed Technique.&nbsp;
However, it's important to note&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:51.280
that you can't simultaneously recover your&nbsp;
physical body and your Cursed Technique.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:56.280
Its one or the other... What I find&nbsp;
most messed up, like Gege is crazy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.280 --> 00:05:00.960
is that rejuvenating a worn-out Cursed Technique&nbsp;
involves damaging the section of the brain where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:05.730
these techniques are imprinted and then healing&nbsp;
it using a Reverse Cursed Technique. Bruh.

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:08.080
(Long Distance Teleportation) Another&nbsp;
ability that Gojo is only able to use&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:13.840
due to his Six Eyes is the advanced technique&nbsp;
Long Distance Teleportation. Like the name says,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:18.560
a Limitless user is able to use spatial&nbsp;
manipulation to teleport long distances,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:22.560
although the user can only teleport them&nbsp;
self instantly with a hand signal. This&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:25.760
is achieved by compressing the space&nbsp;
between the user's location and their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:30.120
desired destination. To teleport multiple&nbsp;
people, the limitless user would need to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:34.680
draw a sorcery circle large enough to hold&nbsp;
the amount of people they want to teleport.

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:39.200
Lastly out of the techniques only a limitless&nbsp;
user can achieve and another advanced one,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:44.280
we have the Hollow Technique Purple. Like I&nbsp;
mentioned before, Blue and Red make up the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:49.880
first 2 main abilities found within limitless.&nbsp;
Hollow Purple the third is the fusion of both of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:54.600
them, a secret ability known to only a few within&nbsp;
the Gojo Family. Who though like straight up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:59.720
this has been said so many times, but&nbsp;
we are still yet to even meet someone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:05.240
other than Gojo from the Gojo clan. Either&nbsp;
way, this ability represents the motion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:09.920
of blue and reversal of red, a fusion of&nbsp;
convergence and divergence that collides&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:15.000
both infinites to generate an imaginary&nbsp;
mass that destroys anything it touches.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:31.720
(Black Flash) Well here is a personal favorite&nbsp;
of mine due to how mappa snaps with every&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:36.080
single application of it in the series,&nbsp;
Black Flash. As everyone’s surely heard,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:39.600
so ill be quick with this one, Black&nbsp;
Flash is a distortion in space that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:46.680
occurs when cursed energy is applied within&nbsp;
0.000001 seconds of a physical hit. When a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:50.400
sorcerer is able to achieve this, their&nbsp;
cursed energy flashes the color black,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:55.640
and the destructive power of their strike is&nbsp;
equal to a normal hit to the power of 2.5.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.640 --> 00:07:02.760
So whatever that normal hit is, chuck it in a&nbsp;
exponent calculator and you’ll get the answer.

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:13.520
Masamichi Yaga - Masamichi Yaga, the 50 year&nbsp;
old man with a crippling plushy addiction has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:17.240
one of the strongest and actually feared&nbsp;
over abilities inside of the series.

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:22.000
(Cursed Corpse Manipulation) Unlike Mahito’s&nbsp;
manipulation of corpses, Masamichi doesn't use&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:26.360
people but instead is able to infuse the dolls&nbsp;
he creates with a cursed energy core in order&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:32.000
to bring the inanimate objects to life and control&nbsp;
them with an incantation. He has developed a wide&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:37.240
variety of different cursed corpses including&nbsp;
Panda, Tsukamoto, Cathy and of-course the lil&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:44.760
man himself Takeru. The reasoning I give behind&nbsp;
him being feared over is actually because the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:49.640
potential threat of a multitude of sentient&nbsp;
cursed corpses nearly lead the higher-ups to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:58.560
promote Masamichi to special grade and place an&nbsp;
indefinite restriction on him. Since that point,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:03.480
Masamichi has kept his other creations a&nbsp;
secret within a forest protected by Tengen.

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:05.440
Yoshinobu Gakuganji - Ahh these three&nbsp;
have been fitting to stick together&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:08.240
if ya know what I mean.. Sadly the&nbsp;
guy who dealt the finishing blow,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:13.366
Yoshinobu Gakuganji had an&nbsp;
even more lethal ability.

00:08:13.366 --> 00:08:16.200
(Gakuganji’s Unnamed Technique) Looking like&nbsp;
a Rockstar and using a technique that we dont&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:21.080
know the name of but have an understanding&nbsp;
of how it works. Gakuganji’s technique uses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:25.680
his body as a form of sound amplification&nbsp;
device, amplifying anything that he plays on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:30.200
his electric guitar and in turn, it launches&nbsp;
waves of amped up electrical cursed energy.

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:34.240
Utahime Iori - Being an avid lover of beer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:37.600
Utahime and her ability’s&nbsp;
effect comes with no surprise.

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:41.440
(Solo forbidden Area) Solo Forbidden Area is an&nbsp;
innate technique that creates a zone around the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:46.360
sorcerer that temporarily amplifies the cursed&nbsp;
energy of any person within range, including&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:52.160
herself. Solo Forbidden Area is not particularly&nbsp;
suited for combat as it requires preparation time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:57.000
and is best applied to enhancing allies. I haven't&nbsp;
mentioned this as of yet, probably could have with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:03.680
Gojo but I rambled on with some of his abilities.&nbsp;
The technique can be elevated into a ritual using&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:09.480
incantations, hand signs, dance, and music. By&nbsp;
including all of these steps, the technique's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:16.120
effectiveness can be raised to 120%. This however&nbsp;
doesn't just work for Utahime, all sorcerers are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:23.865
able to elevate their techniques, its more or&nbsp;
less just a time based thing during battle.

00:09:23.865 --> 00:09:27.160
Yuji Itadori - So that brings all of&nbsp;
the teachers inside of Jujutsu Kaisen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:32.000
both at Kyoto and Jujutsu techs schools&nbsp;
to an end. If I dont mention any specific&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:35.400
characters and their techniques, its&nbsp;
either because we haven't seen them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:39.440
use one or they share in one with another&nbsp;
character that i've already spoken about.

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:49.640
When it comes to Yuji he also doesn't&nbsp;
have any innate or inherited technique,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:54.800
however he is equipped with his own unique&nbsp;
effect. Ps Yuji might be like a few chapters&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.800 --> 00:10:03.680
away from learning a cursed technique, so if he&nbsp;
does end up having one itl be awesome to see him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:09.080
gain something. Like mans used divergent fist for&nbsp;
how long now, and im assuming itl have something&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:12.920
to do with body swapping after seeing that&nbsp;
short section of him practicing with Kusakabe.

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:15.560
When it comes to the big Divergent Fist,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:20.320
simply, if Yuji strikes with his fist&nbsp;
using a thin layer of cursed energy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:25.360
a second wave of cursed energy is unleashed a&nbsp;
few moments afterward, effectively creating two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:30.640
impacts with one punch. This is as Gojo said&nbsp;
early on in the series, because Yuji is to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:36.141
physically quick his cursed energy lags and takes&nbsp;
time to catch up, creating that double impact.

00:10:36.141 --> 00:10:40.360
Megumi Fushiguro - Second of the series main trio,&nbsp;
Megumi Fushiguro is stocked up with an arsenal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:45.376
of Shikigami that originate from an inherited&nbsp;
technique passed down inside of the Zenin Clan.

00:10:45.376 --> 00:10:48.920
(Ten Shadows Technique) This is of course,&nbsp;
the illustrious 10 shadows technique. This&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:53.720
technique grants the user complete manipulation&nbsp;
of shadows, allowing someone to hide in them or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:57.360
store objects. It also grants them the&nbsp;
possibility to summon upto 10 different&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.360 --> 00:11:02.280
Shikigami using a specific correlating hand&nbsp;
signal and the shadows as an intermediary&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:07.000
between the shadow and human realms. When&nbsp;
someone inherits the Ten Shadows Technique,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:11.960
they initially receive two Divine Dogs. From&nbsp;
which other shikigami can be summoned with an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:16.760
exorcism ritual where the user must defeat&nbsp;
the shikigami in order to make them submit.

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:20.960
Throughout the series we see Big Megumi&nbsp;
throw up his gang signs a multitude of times,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:24.506
pretty much allowing us to see all 10 of&nbsp;
his chosen Shikigami from the shadow realm.

00:11:24.506 --> 00:11:27.000
(Divine Dogs) The first Divine&nbsp;
Dogs are a pair of twin wolves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:28.960
that can comfortably take out lower grade curses.

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:32.320
(Divine Dog: Totality) After having the&nbsp;
white hound killed by the finger bearer.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:36.920
Another application of the Ten Shadows Technique&nbsp;
is seen when Megumi uses the liquid like remains&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:41.480
to mix the wolves together, turning them into&nbsp;
one larger and much much stronger Shikigami,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:45.720
The Divine Dog: Totality. Totality is&nbsp;
strong enough to contend with special&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:49.640
grade cursed spirits, making it one&nbsp;
Megumi's strongest offensive shikigami.

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:54.440
(Nue) Probably my favorite out of his&nbsp;
Shikigami, just due to the fact it can fly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:59.400
would have to be Nue. Nue is a winged shikigami&nbsp;
armed with an extremely high top speed and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:04.520
electrical wings. It can 1 person by carrying&nbsp;
them while flying to increase their mobility,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:08.520
and can attack with its heavy wings charged&nbsp;
with electricity, shocking anyone it hits&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:13.360
and leaving them temporarily paralyzed. In&nbsp;
addition to basic offensive applications,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:18.800
Nue's speed and wings can also be used defensively&nbsp;
to shield its user from any potential harm.

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:24.120
(Toad) 3rd of the known Shikigami’s Toad, is a&nbsp;
large frog shikigami that can support its master&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:29.720
using its long tongue. Im assuming you could&nbsp;
ride on it too, or use it like stepping stones&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:34.960
as we saw with Nanami, but its mainly seen using&nbsp;
the tounge. Its tongue can be used to ensnare&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:39.240
its master's target in a tough hold and is strong&nbsp;
enough to throw those same targets around with its&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:44.200
tounge. Its large size also allows it to carried&nbsp;
injured humans in its mouth for protection,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:49.224
but like I mentioned the biggest upside&nbsp;
to the toad is the tounge and its speed.

00:12:49.224 --> 00:12:53.600
(Great Serpent) Next up, big Orochi or the Great&nbsp;
Serpent is a giant snake shikigami that can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:59.000
quickly attack and ensnare its users target within&nbsp;
a constrictive hold. The snake seems to be more of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:03.880
a sneak attack like weapon, as the user can use&nbsp;
it to attack from the shadows at a high speed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:09.240
The Great Serpent's size allows it to overpower&nbsp;
large curses, possibly even swallow them in one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:14.440
go and can also be used to keep a target in place&nbsp;
while other shikigami launch combination attacks.

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:21.440
(Max Elephant) So not including Sukuna’s Shikigami&nbsp;
as we’ll get to those later, Megumi’s Max Elephant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:26.400
is defiantly his most explosive shikigami. As&nbsp;
we’ve all seen, the shikigami is capable of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:30.560
spewing large, violent torrents of water from&nbsp;
its trunk that are capable of pushing back or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:35.720
even drowning the intended target. It can also be&nbsp;
used to crush its masters target with its immense&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:40.760
weight, However, the cost of cursed energy to&nbsp;
summon this Shikigami is huge in comparison to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:46.944
others. This in turn and obviously depending on&nbsp;
the user, will only allow them to summon it once.

00:13:46.944 --> 00:13:51.360
(Rabbit Escape) Being a polar opposite to Max&nbsp;
Elephant, Megumi’s 6th Shikigami, Rabbit Escape,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:55.360
is a massive swarm of rabbit like shikigami&nbsp;
that serve as more of a distraction for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:55.360 --> 00:14:01.400
user than an attack in itself. Upon activating&nbsp;
the technique, dozens, like im unsure if we get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:05.560
an exact number, but a bunch of rabbits&nbsp;
fill the area to distract the opponent,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:10.899
allowing the summoner to escape danger or use them&nbsp;
to his advantage and attack the confused opponent.

00:14:10.899 --> 00:14:12.880
(Eight Handled Sword Divergent Sila Divine&nbsp;
General Mahoraga) Lastly the big man himself,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:19.040
Mahoraga who idek if I should include as apart of&nbsp;
the Ten Shadows or talk about more with Sukuna,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:25.920
but we’ll just do him here. To summon this&nbsp;
being its slightly different. Unlike hand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:31.120
signs with all others, all you need to do&nbsp;
with Mahoraga is extend both arms forward.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:35.680
On top of this, an incantation is required&nbsp;
to bring him forth and begin the ritual.

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:39.000
This being though is by far the&nbsp;
most powerful shikigami available&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:42.600
to be summoned by someone with this&nbsp;
the Ten Shadows Techniques. however,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:46.680
no one in the history of the Zenin Family&nbsp;
has ever been able to force it to submit.

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:52.280
Unlike all other Shikigami, Mahoraga is equipped&nbsp;
with its own kind of techniques. Firstly this dude&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:56.040
is armed with a weapon called the Sword&nbsp;
of Extermination. This blade is attached&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:56.040 --> 00:15:00.520
to the Shikigami’s forearm and enveloped in&nbsp;
positive cursed energy, making it especially&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:05.240
effective against cursed spirits. Secondly,&nbsp;
the being possesses the ability to adapt to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:10.040
any and all phenomena. How this works is that&nbsp;
say, if it is injured by a particular attack,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:15.520
the eight-handled wheel will turn, allowing&nbsp;
it to adapt. This can take up to a few spins&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:19.560
depending on just how in-depth the technique&nbsp;
its trying to adapt is. If after all of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:25.360
spins needed to adapt complete, Mahoraga will&nbsp;
counter it. This works offensively as well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:29.942
allowing Mahoraga to figure out a way around&nbsp;
the technique so he’s able to deal damage.

00:15:29.942 --> 00:15:34.680
Nobara Kugisaki - Third of the series main trio,&nbsp;
Nobara Kugisaki, the country girl actually boasts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:39.200
large reserves of cursed energy and is an&nbsp;
expert at manipulating it to her will. This&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:43.000
isn't specifically mentioned in the anime&nbsp;
or manga, but in the Fanbook we learn where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:48.120
Nobara got her ability from. Like Megumi, the&nbsp;
Straw Doll Technique is passed down inside of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:52.937
the Kugisaki family, with Nobara specifically&nbsp;
inheriting the technique from her grandmother.

00:15:52.937 --> 00:15:56.400
(Straw Doll Technique) The Straw Doll Technique&nbsp;
incorporates a toolset that features a hammer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:56.400 --> 00:16:00.960
nails, and straw doll effigy that has the&nbsp;
ability to greatly improve the user’s cursed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:05.240
energy. By channeling her cursed energy&nbsp;
through the tools, Nobara can utilize a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:10.320
number of different techniques including sharing&nbsp;
damage between her straw doll and her target.

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:14.560
These nails are sent into the user's target&nbsp;
using a hammer to hit and propel them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:19.040
forward as projectiles. The cursed energy&nbsp;
allows the nails to be freely manipulated,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:23.000
giving the user free range of motion&nbsp;
in preparation for that strike.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.760
If the target is hit by the nails,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:28.520
the cursed energy flowing through them&nbsp;
can be used to deal further damage.

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:31.840
(Resonance) Once hitting a target,&nbsp;
the user of straw doll manipulation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:35.280
can use an extension technique. The&nbsp;
first of these is the Resonance,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:39.640
which applies cursed energy to the user's&nbsp;
target using a straw doll as an effigy.

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:43.840
The user will generally use one body part&nbsp;
of their target to create the link and then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:48.840
use resonance to apply damage to more critical&nbsp;
appendages of the opponent's body. For example,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:52.720
by placing a curse's severed arm on the&nbsp;
straw doll and striking it with a nail&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:56.760
using a hammer, the nails can be used&nbsp;
to pierce the targeted curse's heart.

00:16:56.760 --> 00:17:01.440
The effectiveness varies depending on the&nbsp;
opponents skill level, the targeted body part,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:05.880
and the strength of the connection to the user's&nbsp;
target. If a link is made to multiple opponents,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:08.320
Resonance will injure them all at the same time.

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:12.600
(Hairpin) The second and last extension technique&nbsp;
we’ve seen from the straw doll technique,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:16.040
Hairpin allows the user to greatly&nbsp;
enhance the output of their cursed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:16.040 --> 00:17:20.280
energy. Cursed energy shrouding the&nbsp;
nails expands with explosive force,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:24.080
highly magnifying their destructive&nbsp;
capabilities. I think this works by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:29.220
placing a binding vow on the nails that means&nbsp;
they’ll be destroyed after the technique is used.

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:32.520
Junpei Yoshino - So im gonna stick Junpei’s thingy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:35.040
in here cause I really didnt know&nbsp;
where to stick it in the video.

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:42.000
(Moon Dregs) Junpei’s Shikigami Moon&nbsp;
Dregs takes the form of a translucent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:45.840
blue jellyfish with a body large&nbsp;
enough to shroud its user. It has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:49.360
two black eyes and thin yellow&nbsp;
tentacles draping from its body.

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:53.160
Moon Dregs is capable of reshaping its&nbsp;
tentacles as well as portions of its&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:58.400
body to form stingers. It's also capable&nbsp;
of distributing poison with its attacks.

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:05.000
Arata Nitta - So, Kyoto Jujutsu Tech actually&nbsp;
has 1 first year in Arata Nitta. This dude&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:10.840
isn't by any means a physical fighter and is&nbsp;
more seen as a coordinator type. To be honest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:14.920
he reminds me of a manager, probably&nbsp;
just due to the black suit he wears.

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:20.440
(Pain Killer) His ability though, Pain Killer is&nbsp;
a technique that allows Arata to stop existing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:25.520
injuries from getting any worse. The user of&nbsp;
pain killer cant specifically heal wounds,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:30.400
but they can stop bleeding and reduce the pain&nbsp;
for anyone its applied to. The downside of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:36.080
this technique is mainly how it doesn't allow the&nbsp;
user to heal anyone, just sustain their injuries.

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:44.800
Mai Zenin - First of the second&nbsp;
years at Kyoto Tech, Mai Zenin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:48.840
doesn't posses an inherited technique&nbsp;
like the majority of other characters,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:53.160
however she does have her own one that she&nbsp;
created over time. This technique is also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:57.360
seen in another character called Yorozu, that&nbsp;
makes her appearance during the culling game.

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:04.120
(Construction) This ability, Construction is&nbsp;
an inefficient technique that consumes most of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:09.360
the users cursed energy to create something from&nbsp;
nothing. Unlike creating objects within a Domain,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:13.920
things constructed by this technique will not&nbsp;
disappear once the spell has finished. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:22.800
creating something from nothing uses an immense&nbsp;
amount of cursed energy, which results in harsh&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:28.640
backlash on the user's body. So depending on&nbsp;
how much cursed energy the user might have,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:34.143
it will allow them a differing level and&nbsp;
complexity of things they might be able to create.

00:19:34.143 --> 00:19:34.160
(A single Bullet)

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:37.760
Sadly for Mai and her pathetically&nbsp;
small pool of cursed energy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:42.360
all she was able to produce is a single&nbsp;
bullet per day. I should bring it up aswell,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:46.920
but Mai was also able to create a cursed&nbsp;
tool sword at the cost of her life.

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:50.400
Some of the cooler extension techniques&nbsp;
that weve seen from construction come&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:54.600
from Yorozu and her battle&nbsp;
against the king of curses.

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:59.080
(Liquid Metal) Liquid Metal is pretty&nbsp;
much how it sounds, a construction of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:03.480
liquid metal that changeable in shape and&nbsp;
volume with stable physical properties due&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:03.480 --> 00:20:08.400
to the semi-autonomous cursed energy&nbsp;
manipulating it. This here almost&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:11.680
works as a base for the construction&nbsp;
technique to build other things off.

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:16.280
(Insect Armor) For example the user of this&nbsp;
technique could use the liquid metal to create&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:21.680
an Insect Armor which is specialized in adapting&nbsp;
a plethora of different insects abilities and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:25.680
functions. Doing this will inherently help&nbsp;
with sustaining the users cursed energy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:25.680 --> 00:20:32.223
for a longer period of time while simultaneously&nbsp;
enhancing their strength, speed, and durability.

00:20:32.223 --> 00:20:36.680
(Perfect Sphere) Lastly a user of construction&nbsp;
is one of the only beings able to make a perfect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:41.920
sphere. By using that liquid metal and shaping&nbsp;
it into a sphere, the user is able to make a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:47.480
perfect one. A true sphere has no contact area&nbsp;
and generates infinite pressure, as a result,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:47.480 --> 00:20:52.880
making it untouchable. Its kinda like&nbsp;
Gojo’s purple in the idea that its an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:58.120
unstoppable imaginary mass of cursed energy&nbsp;
that will destroy anything in its path.

00:20:58.120 --> 00:21:03.080
Kokichi Muta - Next up on the food chain of&nbsp;
abilities inside of Jujutsu kaisen comes from the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:09.200
traitor himself Kokichi Muta. So we kind of have&nbsp;
a similar ability to Kokichi’s puppet manipulation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:15.120
in Masamichi’s cursed corpse manipulation, but&nbsp;
they are different. Unlike Masamichi who can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:20.600
give the doll control, Kokichi himself controls&nbsp;
these puppets with his adept use of cursed energy.

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:25.120
Sorry Maki but cause im mentioning a heavenly&nbsp;
restriction now, I doubt ill mention you at all!

00:21:25.120 --> 00:21:32.440
(Heavenly Restriction) This Heavenly Restriction&nbsp;
is a restriction placed on someone aswell and not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:37.880
a technique a person will perform themselves. Its&nbsp;
explained to us as a binding that is placed apon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:43.120
a sorcerers body when they are born. Im not sure&nbsp;
if this is an otherworldly un-controllable feat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:48.160
or something the parents perform. What we do&nbsp;
know is that these bindings usually refer to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:53.120
limitations on the human body, this could be&nbsp;
cursed energy related or physically related,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:58.040
in exchange, the person with this&nbsp;
restriction receives improved capabilities.

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:02.040
(Puppet Manipulation) Kokichi who suffers from&nbsp;
an extreme example of a heavenly restriction&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:02.040 --> 00:22:05.520
was gifted with vast amounts of cursed&nbsp;
energy that he used to control massive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:05.520 --> 00:22:10.720
amounts Mechamaru puppets remotely through Puppet&nbsp;
Manipulation. Puppets such as Ultimate Mechamaru&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:17.538
are capable of using explosive cursed energy as&nbsp;
plasma beams among a bevy of other abilities.

00:22:17.538 --> 00:22:18.680
(Batto Sword Drawing) I&nbsp;
should mention this aswell,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:18.680 --> 00:22:22.640
even though I feel like it is more of a barrier&nbsp;
technique since its related to the shadow style,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:22.640 --> 00:22:31.000
but Miwa posses the ability called Batto Sword&nbsp;
Drawing. This ability is an iai sword-drawing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:35.440
technique optimal for striking enemies&nbsp;
situated directly in front of the user.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:35.440 --> 00:22:41.025
It covers the blade with cursed energy and&nbsp;
rotates it, greatly improve the drawing speed.

00:22:41.025 --> 00:22:45.440
Toge Inumaki - So the next 2nd year who actually&nbsp;
has an inherited technique is the mute legend,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:45.440 --> 00:22:50.520
big Inumaki Toge and his Cursed Speech.

00:22:53.160 --> 00:22:55.400
(Cursed Speech) Cursed Speech&nbsp;
is an inherited technique of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:55.400 --> 00:22:59.320
Inumaki Family. It reinforces the&nbsp;
user's words with cursed energy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:59.320 --> 00:23:03.360
which compels the listeners to act or&nbsp;
be acted upon based on those words.

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:07.640
To execute cursed speech, the user must&nbsp;
use a cursed tool with a particular set&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:11.880
of seals on it. For example, the mute&nbsp;
king has seal markings on his cheeks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:11.880 --> 00:23:17.400
and tongue. Whereas the original MC Yuta&nbsp;
has a tool created by the Inumaki Family,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:17.400 --> 00:23:21.400
the "Serpent Eyes and Fang", which&nbsp;
has those same markings on it.

00:23:21.400 --> 00:23:25.080
Cursed speech is activated when the user&nbsp;
utters words or commands aloud that are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:25.080 --> 00:23:30.280
reinforced with cursed energy. This action&nbsp;
compels the listener to act or be acted upon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:30.280 --> 00:23:35.520
as a command. For example, a cursed speech&nbsp;
user can command his opponent to stop moving,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:35.520 --> 00:23:40.920
or for them to be crushed. The strength of the&nbsp;
compulsion depends on the skill level of the user.

00:23:40.920 --> 00:23:45.480
As Cursed Speech uses language and is a more&nbsp;
wild technique, it can make it dangerous to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:50.440
casually speak with other people. Civilians&nbsp;
and anyone within the range of the user will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:50.440 --> 00:23:55.440
be affected if they accidentally hear the wrong&nbsp;
word. As a countermeasure, users of cursed speech&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:55.440 --> 00:24:01.072
tend to limit their casual language to certain&nbsp;
safe words to avoid triggering cursed speech.

00:24:01.072 --> 00:24:05.160
Panda - Back when I first mentioned Masamichi&nbsp;
I really didnt know if I should include this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:05.160 --> 00:24:09.400
cuddly bear as apart of his Cursed&nbsp;
Corpse Manipulation or have Panda as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:09.400 --> 00:24:13.200
his own person with techniques.&nbsp;
Obviously I decided the latter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:13.200 --> 00:24:18.040
as this dude is his own person with&nbsp;
his own abilities and feelings.

00:24:18.040 --> 00:24:24.880
(Cursed Corpse Cores) Due to him being a puppet&nbsp;
Panda didnt exactly have the ability to inherit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:24.880 --> 00:24:29.880
a technique, however he instead possesses&nbsp;
what's called Cursed Corpse Cores. Inside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:29.880 --> 00:24:34.600
of him are 3 cores, all with differing&nbsp;
personalities and powers. Panda's body:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:34.600 --> 00:24:38.080
the balanced and main form, the&nbsp;
power form called Gorilla mode,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:38.080 --> 00:24:43.560
and a third core called Triceratops mode.&nbsp;
At base Panda technically has 3 lives,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:43.560 --> 00:24:49.665
but if any of these cores are damaged, Panda is&nbsp;
unable to shift into that form until it recovers.

00:24:49.665 --> 00:24:52.520
(Gorilla Mode) By switching to his&nbsp;
"brother's" core, and going Gorilla Mode,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:52.520 --> 00:24:56.800
Panda can transform into a muscular&nbsp;
gorilla. Panda is much stronger and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:56.800 --> 00:25:01.132
faster in this form but at the cost&nbsp;
of rapidly draining his cursed energy.

00:25:01.132 --> 00:25:04.160
(Unblockable Drumming Beat) A secondary&nbsp;
technique available while in Gorilla Mode,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:04.160 --> 00:25:08.440
Unblockable Drumming Beat allows any strike&nbsp;
Panda lands to resonate through the targets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:08.440 --> 00:25:13.280
body. The idea behind this is similar&nbsp;
to Yuji’s divergent punch in which even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:13.280 --> 00:25:17.640
if the person blocks, they still feel some&nbsp;
form of secondary damage resonate through.

00:25:17.640 --> 00:25:21.720
(Triceratops Mode) Finally by&nbsp;
switching to his "sister's" core,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:21.720 --> 00:25:26.760
Panda can transform into Triceratops mode.&nbsp;
Apparently this is the most destructive form,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:26.760 --> 00:25:30.680
but as we haven't seen to much from her&nbsp;
so far, all we can do is take Panda’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:30.680 --> 00:25:35.480
word. Panda apparently claims his sister's&nbsp;
form destroys everyone who looks at her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:35.480 --> 00:25:39.720
because of her shyness, however the 1&nbsp;
time she turned up it didnt go to well.

00:25:39.720 --> 00:25:44.200
Yuta Okkotsu - Ahh now we get&nbsp;
to talk about the ability thief,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:44.200 --> 00:25:48.520
the Kakashi wannabe of jjk,&nbsp;
the original mc, Maki’s girl,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:48.520 --> 00:25:53.770
Big Yutta Okkotsu and the plethora of&nbsp;
abilities this guy’s got stored up.

00:25:53.770 --> 00:25:57.240
(Complete Rika Manifestation) While connected to&nbsp;
Rika through his ring, Yuta can fully manifest the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:57.240 --> 00:25:59.160
queen of curses, use cursed techniques, and access&nbsp;
her supply of cursed energy to replenish his own.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:59.160 --> 00:26:05.400
Rika also has the ability to store a wide&nbsp;
range cursed tools and can equip them to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:05.400 --> 00:26:10.840
Yuta at will. There is a time limit to her full&nbsp;
manifestation though as he can only maintain a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:10.840 --> 00:26:16.200
sustained connection with Rika and remain in this&nbsp;
state for five minutes at a time. Im assuming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:16.200 --> 00:26:21.480
this is because the ring is like a doorway to&nbsp;
whatever realm the unraveled Rika now abides in.

00:26:21.480 --> 00:26:28.440
(Copy) While connected to Rika, Yuta can copy&nbsp;
innate techniques and use them. He can even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:28.440 --> 00:26:32.960
use multiple different techniques that he's&nbsp;
copied in quick succession. Plus once copying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:32.960 --> 00:26:38.360
them while Rika is out, he can then use those&nbsp;
same abilities when ever. The conditions under&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:38.360 --> 00:26:43.080
which he can copy a technique are not fully known,&nbsp;
but it is implied he gained the ability to copy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:43.080 --> 00:26:48.800
Uro's Sky Manipulation after Rika consumed&nbsp;
her arm. So far out of the ones weve seen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:48.800 --> 00:26:53.720
Yuta has been able to copy; Cursed Speech,&nbsp;
Sky Manipulation and Thin Ice Breaker.

00:26:53.720 --> 00:26:58.160
(Cursed Energy Blast) Yuta can only&nbsp;
fire a directed blast of cursed energy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:58.160 --> 00:27:03.320
when Rika is completely manifested. Together,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:03.320 --> 00:27:07.400
they can fire a beam that is just&nbsp;
shy of matching Ryu's Granite Blast.

00:27:07.400 --> 00:27:10.740
Putting Uro’s abilities aside&nbsp;
cause ill speak more on them later.

00:27:10.740 --> 00:27:15.320
(Shikigami) Yuta can also summon shikigami&nbsp;
using his hair as an intermediary. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:15.320 --> 00:27:19.320
shikigami appear as small bats with&nbsp;
heads similar to that of Rika's. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:19.320 --> 00:27:23.400
fly around the opponent to form a sphere&nbsp;
like domain that can slash anyone inside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:23.400 --> 00:27:30.160
it. Just incase you thought this was an&nbsp;
ability of his, Yuta copied this technique.

00:27:33.600 --> 00:27:36.480
So thats all of the second&nbsp;
years from both schools covered,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:36.480 --> 00:27:42.465
now I guess we better touch&nbsp;
on the big dogs, the seniors.

00:27:42.465 --> 00:27:46.840
Kinji Hakari - Hakari Hakari Hakari, now&nbsp;
I initially thought I was going to be here&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:46.840 --> 00:27:51.200
for a year trying to explain this silly old&nbsp;
technique. Then I realized, its his domain.

00:27:51.200 --> 00:27:57.040
(Private Pure Love Train) Hakari’s Innate&nbsp;
technique is called Private Pure Love Train,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:57.040 --> 00:28:01.600
this is a pachinko-themed technique that is&nbsp;
primarily applied through his domain expansion.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:01.600 --> 00:28:06.680
The cursed technique imbued into the domain&nbsp;
manifests Private Pure Love Train, a pachinko game&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:06.680 --> 00:28:12.680
inspired by the previously mentioned romance manga&nbsp;
series. However the reason I bring it up as a solo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:12.680 --> 00:28:18.160
technique is because Hakari can summon the visual&nbsp;
effect indicators of the game, such as the shutter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:18.160 --> 00:28:23.440
doors outside of his domain. They can then be&nbsp;
used to catch, block or even damage the opponent.

00:28:23.440 --> 00:28:30.080
Kirara Hoshi - Next up and a big lover of&nbsp;
the FEVER, Kirara Hoshi has one of those&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:30.080 --> 00:28:36.502
techniques that just make your brain rot with&nbsp;
confusion. Like how do you even think this one up.

00:28:36.502 --> 00:28:39.960
(Love Rendezvous) This technique named&nbsp;
Love Rendezvous assigns five "stars★" with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:39.960 --> 00:28:44.960
a Southern Cross shape in order to target&nbsp;
cursed energy. The five stars are ★Imai,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:44.960 --> 00:28:48.240
★Acrux, ★Mimosa, ★Ginan, and ★Gacrux.

00:28:48.240 --> 00:28:52.120
In order to mark something with a star,&nbsp;
the user must make physical contact with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:52.120 --> 00:28:55.760
someone's cursed energy. Anyone that&nbsp;
has been marked will experience a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:55.760 --> 00:28:59.120
sparking light above their head when&nbsp;
the technique is activated. They can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:59.120 --> 00:29:03.480
also find the name of the star they've been&nbsp;
marked with written somewhere on their body.

00:29:03.480 --> 00:29:08.240
Only one star can be placed on one person's&nbsp;
cursed energy at a time but the same star can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:08.240 --> 00:29:12.840
be applied to multiple different people&nbsp;
simultaneously. This includes the user,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:12.840 --> 00:29:16.640
so if they've marked themselves with a star,&nbsp;
they must remove it before then deciding to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:16.640 --> 00:29:21.400
mark another object. If the user needs to&nbsp;
mark multiple different objects with stars,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:21.400 --> 00:29:25.360
the objects need to be charged by&nbsp;
someone else's cursed energy beforehand.

00:29:25.360 --> 00:29:29.520
Cursed energy shared between a sorcerer and&nbsp;
their shikigami is considered the same by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:29.520 --> 00:29:34.760
Love Rendezvous. The user can mark both the&nbsp;
Shikigami owner and their Shikigami with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:34.760 --> 00:29:39.880
star at the same time. They can even place a star&nbsp;
on the sorcerer without touching them directly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:39.880 --> 00:29:43.360
simply by making contact with&nbsp;
the Shikigami. If this happens,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:43.360 --> 00:29:47.200
the one with the higher cursed energy&nbsp;
output will pull the other when attracted.

00:29:47.200 --> 00:29:50.240
Anyone marked with a star must&nbsp;
follow a specific order if they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:50.240 --> 00:29:54.080
want to attempt moving towards another&nbsp;
star. If they dont follow the ordering,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:54.080 --> 00:29:58.360
targets with the same star will attract each&nbsp;
other making it impossible to escape. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:58.360 --> 00:30:02.920
determined route that you have to follow works&nbsp;
by following the nearest star first and finishing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:02.920 --> 00:30:10.040
at the furthest one. The order we’ve seen is&nbsp;
★Imai → ★Acrux → ★Mimosa → ★Ginan → ★Gacrux.

00:30:10.040 --> 00:30:30.280
Momo Nishimiya - Time to get away from&nbsp;
the mind bending spatial abilities and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:30.280 --> 00:30:32.560
move onto something a bit more down to earth.

00:30:32.560 --> 00:30:36.960
(Tool Manipulation) Momo Nishimiya is&nbsp;
equipped with an innate technique called&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:36.960 --> 00:30:42.520
Tool Manipulation. Along with other broom related&nbsp;
things, this technique grants the user the ability&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:42.520 --> 00:30:48.826
to levitate the tool, fly on the tool or create&nbsp;
gusts of powerful wind imbued with cursed energy.

00:30:48.826 --> 00:30:51.880
(Wind Scythe) An extension of Tool&nbsp;
Manipulation, Wind Scythe is used&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:51.880 --> 00:30:56.120
by swinging the users broom as they ride it.&nbsp;
This can effectively create strong gusts of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:56.120 --> 00:31:01.589
cursed energy infused wind, strong enough&nbsp;
to push people back or even wound them.

00:31:01.589 --> 00:31:06.120
Aoi Todo - Do you feel it brother? I&nbsp;
tell you an arm is merely a decoration,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:06.120 --> 00:31:12.200
but the act of applause is the acclimation of&nbsp;
the soul itself. Himothy, Big Todo has one of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:12.200 --> 00:31:17.880
the most simplistic abilities inside of the verse,&nbsp;
but oml can he abuse the absolute hell out of it.

00:31:21.080 --> 00:31:24.800
(Boogie Woogie) Boogie Woogie the body switching&nbsp;
ability activates when the user claps their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:24.800 --> 00:31:29.680
hands together. The technique switches the&nbsp;
positions of the user and anything they desire,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:29.680 --> 00:31:32.320
all they need to do is make sure&nbsp;
whatever they intend to switch,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:32.320 --> 00:31:37.400
has some level of cursed energy. They&nbsp;
dont have to always switch themselves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:37.400 --> 00:31:42.204
as the user can also switch other peoples&nbsp;
locations as long as they have cursed energy.

00:31:42.204 --> 00:31:44.120
Noritoshi Kamo &amp; Big Bro Choso - So that&nbsp;
is kinda all we know about Boogie Woogie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:44.120 --> 00:31:49.400
there really isnt too much to it like&nbsp;
some of the other ones. Another of these&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:49.400 --> 00:31:53.120
highly complex abilities comes from a&nbsp;
duo you could almost call father and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:53.120 --> 00:31:59.219
son... The Blood Manipulation of&nbsp;
Noritoshi Kamo and Big Bro Choso.

00:31:59.219 --> 00:32:02.080
(Blood Manipulation) As it implies, Blood&nbsp;
Manipulation is a cursed technique that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:02.080 --> 00:32:06.120
allows the user to control and shape their&nbsp;
blood beyond its natural form or motion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:06.120 --> 00:32:11.200
for a variety of effects. It can be used to&nbsp;
manipulate every aspect of the user's blood,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:11.200 --> 00:32:16.760
including blood composition, internal blood flow,&nbsp;
plasma, pulse rate, body temperature and red blood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:16.760 --> 00:32:22.600
cells. It also allows them to control the blood&nbsp;
externally as long as it belongs to the user.

00:32:22.600 --> 00:32:26.800
External blood can be hardened or&nbsp;
shaped to create mid-range projectiles.

00:32:26.800 --> 00:32:31.440
As with any cursed technique, Blood Manipulation's&nbsp;
efficiency and strength depend on who wields&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:31.440 --> 00:32:36.200
it. With this technique we’ve seen two vastly&nbsp;
different people use it. In my personal opinion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:36.200 --> 00:32:42.240
and due to him being human Noritoshi Kamo's use of&nbsp;
blood manipulation falls short to that of Choso.

00:32:42.240 --> 00:32:46.960
This is mainly for the fact that the user is&nbsp;
limited by the amount of their own blood they have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:46.960 --> 00:32:52.880
access to. Too much blood loss could obviously&nbsp;
result in death, so users generally prepare&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:52.880 --> 00:33:00.000
blood bags or weapons dipped in their blood&nbsp;
in advance. Unless your built like Choso. Also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:05.660
another factor of blood manipulation is that&nbsp;
the blood is poisonous to cursed spirits.

00:33:05.660 --> 00:33:08.920
(Flowing Red Scale) The first of many&nbsp;
extension techniques, Flowing Red Scale,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:08.920 --> 00:33:13.440
Increases the user's body temperature, pulse&nbsp;
rate, and the number of red blood cells to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:13.440 --> 00:33:17.880
give themselves greatly increased&nbsp;
energy and physical capabilities.

00:33:17.880 --> 00:33:21.760
(Flowing Red Scale: Stack) Flowing Red Scale:&nbsp;
Stack Intensifies Flowing Red Scale in order to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:21.760 --> 00:33:26.960
increase the user's physical capabilities&nbsp;
to an even higher degree than normally.

00:33:26.960 --> 00:33:29.280
(Crimson Binding) Third of this&nbsp;
techniques extension techniques,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:29.280 --> 00:33:35.381
Crimson Binding Transforms blood into a&nbsp;
widespread net that tightly ensnares the target.

00:33:35.381 --> 00:33:38.320
(Slicing Exorcism) Slicing Exorcism&nbsp;
is a long-range attack that allows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:38.320 --> 00:33:41.080
the user to slice or shoot&nbsp;
their opponent. It can take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:41.080 --> 00:33:46.040
the form of a quickly rotating disc&nbsp;
of blood or a long stream of blood.

00:33:46.040 --> 00:33:50.200
(Convergence) Convergence is a baseline&nbsp;
technique within blood manipulation. This&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:50.200 --> 00:33:54.840
technique is mainly used first in combination&nbsp;
with others to perform an extension technique.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:54.840 --> 00:33:59.040
Convergence is achieved when blood is compressed&nbsp;
and condensed to its limit between the palms&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:59.040 --> 00:34:03.360
of the user. From that a compressed blood&nbsp;
sphere will be formed. Because it requires&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:03.360 --> 00:34:09.583
time to apply Convergence to blood, user is&nbsp;
vulnerable against fast and quick attacks.

00:34:09.583 --> 00:34:12.920
(Piercing Blood) After using Convergence,&nbsp;
a few options are available for a blood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:12.920 --> 00:34:17.600
manipulation user. One of these, Piercing&nbsp;
Blood applies that compressed blood and uses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:17.600 --> 00:34:22.320
it in a long ranged beam of blood that will&nbsp;
pretty much go through anything it touches.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:22.320 --> 00:34:26.440
Once skillfully reinforced with cursed&nbsp;
energy, it can reach the speed of sound,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:26.440 --> 00:34:30.240
however any subsequent movement will&nbsp;
cause it to slow. This ability is so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:30.240 --> 00:34:34.640
deadly that if you get hit by it without&nbsp;
expecting the attack, you will be pierced.

00:34:34.640 --> 00:34:39.800
(Supernova) Another option available&nbsp;
after using Convergence is Supernova.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:39.800 --> 00:34:42.480
To do this the user will create&nbsp;
multiple small orbs of blood,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:42.480 --> 00:34:46.120
then have those said orbs shoot out in&nbsp;
every direction like a buckshot. These&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:46.120 --> 00:34:52.187
smaller orbs of blood are somewhat hardened,&nbsp;
adding to the damage someone might receive.

00:34:52.187 --> 00:34:55.960
(Blood Edge) A quick utilization of Blood&nbsp;
Manipulations ability to harden blood,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:55.960 --> 00:35:01.542
Blood Edge strengthens the user's blood&nbsp;
density by rotating it at a high speed.

00:35:01.542 --> 00:35:04.880
(Blood Meteorite) Using some of those same&nbsp;
properties, Blood Meteorite is used when the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:04.880 --> 00:35:09.000
user hardens some of their blood, to an almost&nbsp;
crystalized level, before throwing it at their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:09.000 --> 00:35:13.880
target. Its most lethal within short ranges as&nbsp;
the speed will drastically decrease overtime.

00:35:13.880 --> 00:35:17.960
Suguru Geto - Moving on from one&nbsp;
manipulator to another though,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:17.960 --> 00:35:23.931
Suguru Geto and then subsequently Kenjaku&nbsp;
have both been seen in use of this technique.

00:35:23.931 --> 00:35:26.960
(Cursed Spirit Manipulation) As the name&nbsp;
suggests, Cursed Spirit Manipulation is a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:26.960 --> 00:35:30.600
technique where like the Ten Shadows&nbsp;
Technique, one can control a being,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:30.600 --> 00:35:35.400
in this example a cursed spirit they were able&nbsp;
to conquer in battle. Rather than exorcise the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:35.400 --> 00:35:40.040
cursed spirit, the user can absorb them into&nbsp;
a small black sphere before consuming them.

00:35:40.040 --> 00:35:44.040
Orally consuming this orb gives the&nbsp;
user complete dominance over the curse,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:44.040 --> 00:35:46.800
allowing them to summon them&nbsp;
at any time in the future.

00:35:46.800 --> 00:35:51.600
If the difference in grade is two levels or more,&nbsp;
the curse manipulator can absorb a cursed spirit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:51.600 --> 00:35:55.680
with practically no conditions attached.&nbsp;
The user can extract the curse technique&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:55.680 --> 00:36:00.560
from semi-grade 1 and above cursed spirits they&nbsp;
absorb, providing them with an immense arsenal of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:00.560 --> 00:36:05.640
potential different moves. However, the quality&nbsp;
of the cursed spirit's technique ceases to grow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:05.640 --> 00:36:10.520
the moment they are absorbed and the user can&nbsp;
only use that Technique once. For example this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:10.520 --> 00:36:15.240
is what Kenjaku’s plan was during Shibuya, the&nbsp;
growth of Mahito to such a high degree that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:15.240 --> 00:36:20.080
could absorb him and use a country-wide idle&nbsp;
transfiguration, starting the culling game.

00:36:20.080 --> 00:36:23.840
Like I mentioned before, Cursed Spirit&nbsp;
Manipulation operates functionally the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:23.840 --> 00:36:28.840
same as Shikigami conjuring. However, no&nbsp;
intermediary like a hand sign is required.

00:36:28.840 --> 00:36:32.680
There doesn't appear to be any limit on the&nbsp;
number of curses that can be absorbed and it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:32.680 --> 00:36:37.941
is unknown what happens to the cursed&nbsp;
spirits taken in after the user dies.

00:36:37.941 --> 00:36:41.120
(Maximum: Uzumaki) A possible way to rid&nbsp;
ones self of all these curses though,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:41.120 --> 00:36:45.560
is through the users Maximum Technique:&nbsp;
Uzumaki. This ability takes all of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:45.560 --> 00:36:50.040
cursed spirits that the user of cursed spirit&nbsp;
manipulation has absorbed and merges them into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:50.040 --> 00:36:54.800
one. Initially I thought this was a beam like&nbsp;
ability, but Uzumaki itself takes the form of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:54.800 --> 00:36:59.240
a swirling cursed spirit that levitates&nbsp;
behind the user. Once unleashed, it darts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:36:59.240 --> 00:37:05.088
forward to whatever was targeted and unleashes a&nbsp;
powerful attack of super condensed cursed energy.

00:37:05.088 --> 00:37:06.840
Mimiko Hasaba -78 (Teddy Noose)&nbsp;
Moving forward again and I didn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:06.840 --> 00:37:11.040
know this before doing some research, but&nbsp;
Mimiko's technique Teddy Noose allows her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:11.040 --> 00:37:15.760
to hang her targets using a noose. Hence&nbsp;
those hung managers throughout Shibuya!&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:16.640 --> 00:37:20.400
Although the exact mechanics of how it&nbsp;
works is unknown, Mimiko's technique&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:20.400 --> 00:37:26.087
involves the usage of both the rope and her&nbsp;
stuffed childhood toy that she keeps on her.

00:37:26.087 --> 00:37:28.000
Nanako Hasaba - 77(Camera Phone) One&nbsp;
of the more modern implementations of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:28.000 --> 00:37:32.560
a cursed technique is shown when we see&nbsp;
Nanako try and snap a picture of Sukuna.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:32.560 --> 00:37:36.800
Nanako's technique Camera Phone allows her&nbsp;
to manipulate a photographed subject that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:36.800 --> 00:37:41.160
she takes an image of using the camera&nbsp;
on her cellphone. She once used it on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:41.160 --> 00:37:45.733
herself to dodge one of Jogo’s attacks,&nbsp;
but the process tired her out quickly.

00:37:45.733 --> 00:37:53.040
(Knives Out) Bayer - So the only member from&nbsp;
the cursed user group Q to have an ability&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:53.040 --> 00:37:57.920
that we somewhat might know is Bayer and those&nbsp;
knives of his. Im calling this ability Knives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:57.920 --> 00:38:02.320
out cause it sounds dope, but im assuming&nbsp;
that its some sort of Tool Manipulation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:02.320 --> 00:38:06.080
like ability in which he can freely&nbsp;
manipulate knives with cursed energy.

00:38:07.600 --> 00:38:08.785
(Professional Sorcerers)

00:38:08.785 --> 00:38:11.520
Kento Nanami - I think its fitting that&nbsp;
with the very first professional sorcerers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:11.520 --> 00:38:15.800
techniques that we go over, we start with&nbsp;
the model example of what a grade 1 Jujutsu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:15.800 --> 00:38:22.600
Sorcerer is. The big Man Kento Nanami and&nbsp;
his ability to Ratio the hell out of anyone.

00:38:22.600 --> 00:38:27.920
(Ratio Technique) A user of Ratio Technique&nbsp;
is able to mark their target's body with lines&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:27.920 --> 00:38:33.280
divided into tenths. If the user is able to strike&nbsp;
one of these lines on exactly the seven-to-three&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:33.280 --> 00:38:38.440
ratio point, they deliver a critical hit to the&nbsp;
subject. This allows them to deal significant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:38.440 --> 00:38:43.120
damage on stronger opponents and absolutely&nbsp;
body the hell out of anyone weaker than them.

00:38:43.120 --> 00:38:46.680
The lines don't have to measure&nbsp;
up to the target's full length,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:46.680 --> 00:38:52.240
height or wingspan. Their head, torso, biceps,&nbsp;
and forearms are all area’s that someone with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:52.240 --> 00:38:56.600
this technique can individually target.&nbsp;
On top of that, the technique doesn't have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:38:56.600 --> 00:39:01.560
to be used on curses or people, and can even&nbsp;
be used on inanimate objects like buildings.

00:39:01.560 --> 00:39:06.440
(Collapse) The only extension technique that&nbsp;
we’ve seen a user of the Ratio ability use is,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:06.440 --> 00:39:11.760
Collapse. Instead of a singular target, Collapse&nbsp;
expands the overall target area of what can be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:11.760 --> 00:39:16.440
hit by the ratio technique. Simply, it creates&nbsp;
a weak point in the surrounding environment,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:16.440 --> 00:39:21.040
allowing the user to deliver a critical hit&nbsp;
and destroy it. The impact of this technique&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:21.040 --> 00:39:25.960
is so powerful it creates shockwaves of cursed&nbsp;
energy that rips through its effective hit zone.

00:39:25.960 --> 00:39:30.440
For anyone wondering why I haven't&nbsp;
mentioned overtime and revealing ones hand,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:30.440 --> 00:39:36.227
well those are just binding vows and ill go&nbsp;
over all of the binding vows in another video.

00:39:36.227 --> 00:39:39.040
Takuma Ino - Extremely fitting to&nbsp;
stick these two people and their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:39.040 --> 00:39:43.560
abilities together, as this guy here Takuma&nbsp;
Ino im pretty sure was either some kind of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:43.560 --> 00:39:49.520
student or friend to Nanami before becoming&nbsp;
a professional sorcerer. Even now he still&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:49.520 --> 00:39:53.702
insists that Nanami is the only person&nbsp;
to recommend him for the role of grade 1.

00:39:53.702 --> 00:39:58.520
(Auspicious Beast Summon) Takuma’s Technique&nbsp;
though Auspicious Beast Summon is extremely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:39:58.520 --> 00:40:02.800
interesting as it plays into the idea of&nbsp;
summoning a soul from another world. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:02.800 --> 00:40:07.480
ABS is a type of séance technique that&nbsp;
when the users face is hidden from view,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:07.480 --> 00:40:11.680
transforms them into a spiritual medium&nbsp;
for that beast. From what we’ve seen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:11.680 --> 00:40:15.600
people with this Technique can bring forth&nbsp;
the power of the auspicious beasts numbers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:15.600 --> 00:40:20.400
one thru four. Each of the beasts abilities&nbsp;
are manifested by the user's cursed energy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:20.400 --> 00:40:23.920
and can be summoned by calling out&nbsp;
the desired beast's name and number.

00:40:23.920 --> 00:40:28.560
Unlike Shikigami or Cursed Spirit Manipulation,&nbsp;
Auspicious Beast Summon does not create spirits&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:28.560 --> 00:40:33.160
to fight alongside their master. Instead,&nbsp;
the abilities of the Auspicious Beasts are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:33.160 --> 00:40:37.240
materialized through cursed energy&nbsp;
for the user to utilize themselves.

00:40:37.240 --> 00:40:43.000
(Kaichi) Auspicious Beast number one, Kaichi&nbsp;
summons a horn with a spiral pattern on it. It can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:43.000 --> 00:40:48.280
be fired as a homing projectile cloaked in cursed&nbsp;
energy that won't stop until it hits its target.

00:40:48.280 --> 00:40:54.800
(Reiki) The second Auspicious Beast, Reiki&nbsp;
Covers Ino's body in cursed water that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:40:54.800 --> 00:40:59.020
can be used to cushion him from danger&nbsp;
and or increases his overall mobility.

00:40:59.020 --> 00:41:03.080
(Kirin) Auspicious Beast Number Three&nbsp;
Kirin pretty much allows the user to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:03.080 --> 00:41:07.000
fight with a massively reduced sense of&nbsp;
pain. This will drain the users stamina&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:07.000 --> 00:41:10.760
simultaneously making them extremely&nbsp;
tired, and completely unable to fall&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:10.760 --> 00:41:15.400
asleep. Once the beast has been summoned and&nbsp;
whatever was needed to be done is completed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:15.400 --> 00:41:19.840
the user wont be able to function for a limited&nbsp;
amount of time. We’ve never actually seen the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:19.840 --> 00:41:24.320
use of this beast, so i've only been able&nbsp;
to go off what Ino’s said about its powers.

00:41:24.320 --> 00:41:30.680
(Ryu) Another of the beasts we haven't really&nbsp;
seen but know a little about. Auspicious Beast&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:30.680 --> 00:41:35.200
number four, Ryu was about to be used&nbsp;
in Ino’s battle against the Séance user,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:35.200 --> 00:41:39.280
However Toji Zenin got his ass. Up to&nbsp;
that point, nobody had ever survived&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:39.280 --> 00:41:45.400
to tell the tale after fighting Ryu...&nbsp;
Once again according to Ino thooo haha!

00:41:45.400 --> 00:41:51.600
Mei Mei - Time for big sis and the creepy brother&nbsp;
that follows her around everywhere. Man is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:52.400 --> 00:41:56.240
desperate. Ofcourse im talking about Mei Mei and&nbsp;
her dope ability called Black Bird Manipulation.

00:41:56.240 --> 00:42:01.760
(Black Bird Manipulation) So as you’ve seen,&nbsp;
Black Bird Manipulation allows the user to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:01.760 --> 00:42:06.880
imbue crows with cursed energy and control them&nbsp;
at will. Im not sure if its specifically crows,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:06.880 --> 00:42:12.880
but it seems that way. The user of this ability&nbsp;
can manipulate multiple crows at the same time.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:12.880 --> 00:42:16.920
Additionally, the user can also share vision&nbsp;
with the birds, making the technique perfect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:16.920 --> 00:42:22.000
for surveillance. The crows that have been imbued&nbsp;
with cursed energy are under absolute control,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:22.000 --> 00:42:27.000
so if needed they can be used to strike the&nbsp;
opponent, even at the cost of the bird's own life.

00:42:27.000 --> 00:42:30.960
(Bird Strike) That brings us to the one extension&nbsp;
technique we’ve seen Mei Mei use with Black&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:30.960 --> 00:42:37.040
bird Manipulation, Bird Strike. In order to&nbsp;
exceed the limits of the normally weak crows,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:37.040 --> 00:42:40.680
a Black Bird Manipulator can force&nbsp;
their crows to commit no life. By&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:40.680 --> 00:42:43.960
hurling a crow imbued with cursed&nbsp;
energy beyond its normal limits,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:43.960 --> 00:42:48.920
the user can unleash a devastating attack that&nbsp;
is normally a one-hit finisher. Apparently and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:48.920 --> 00:42:54.032
according to Mei Mei, the only person able&nbsp;
to stop it is Gojo. But that might be cap.

00:42:54.032 --> 00:42:59.200
Ui Ui - When it comes to Ui Ui the specifics of&nbsp;
his innate technique are unknown. Mei Mei said&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:59.200 --> 00:43:03.640
it allowed them both to escape a battle by&nbsp;
transferring them from Japan to Malaysia.

00:43:03.640 --> 00:43:08.000
(Gateway) So im legit just gonna go ahead&nbsp;
and say he has some form of teleportation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:08.000 --> 00:43:12.520
or gateway like ability. Adding more credence&nbsp;
to this, his technique also allowed him to act&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:12.520 --> 00:43:16.240
as someone who could communicate with&nbsp;
people inside and outside of barriers.

00:43:16.240 --> 00:43:22.680
Yuki Tsukumo - Someone who&nbsp;
doesn't cap in the slightest,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:22.680 --> 00:43:26.720
and even decided to mentally ruin&nbsp;
Suguru Geto with her talk-no Jutsu,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:26.720 --> 00:43:30.960
then beat the ass of the guy who stole his&nbsp;
body. OFCOURSE im talking about the QUEEN&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:30.960 --> 00:43:36.520
and most powerful professional sorcerer, the&nbsp;
special grade, Yuki Tsukumo and her star rage.

00:43:36.520 --> 00:43:40.960
(Garuda) First thing I need to mention is&nbsp;
that this technique has a Shikigami called&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:40.960 --> 00:43:46.480
Garuda associated with it, its 100% apart of&nbsp;
the technique so im just gonna label it as an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:46.480 --> 00:43:52.120
extension. Garuda can have virtual mass added&nbsp;
to it using Star Rage, as it's the only thing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:52.120 --> 00:43:56.440
affected by the cursed technique other than&nbsp;
the user. What makes it even more confusing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:43:59.400 --> 00:44:04.920
is that Star Rage transforms Garuda into a cursed&nbsp;
tool that the user can use in battle. Garuda can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:04.920 --> 00:44:12.780
also act and fight independently regardless;&nbsp;
whether or not Star Rage is active as well.

00:44:12.780 --> 00:44:16.840
(Star Rage) When it comes to&nbsp;
her main technique, Star Rage,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:16.840 --> 00:44:21.520
the primary function of it is to empower its user&nbsp;
with the ability to add mass to themselves and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:21.520 --> 00:44:27.520
the shikigami associated with this technique.&nbsp;
The mass added is virtual or imaginary, but it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:27.520 --> 00:44:32.720
always increases the user's physical attacks with&nbsp;
force equal to the real mass assigned to them.

00:44:32.720 --> 00:44:35.760
The added mass doesn't weigh&nbsp;
down the user or its Shikigami,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:35.760 --> 00:44:39.760
but it also doesn't increase their&nbsp;
body's overall weight aswell.

00:44:39.760 --> 00:44:43.800
However there is a density threshold to&nbsp;
how much virtual or imaginary mass the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:43.800 --> 00:44:49.560
user can stack on themselves. If taken to&nbsp;
far and they add way to much mass/density&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:49.560 --> 00:44:53.800
to themselves it will condense their body&nbsp;
into a black hole with extreme gravity,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:53.800 --> 00:44:58.520
ripping everything around into it. This is&nbsp;
no question one of the strongest abilities&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:44:58.520 --> 00:45:03.720
in the series, it just sucks we never got&nbsp;
to see it used in more than 2 battles.

00:45:03.720 --> 00:45:16.520
Naobito Zenin &amp; Naoya Zenin - When it comes to&nbsp;
the Zenin Family, they’re meant to be known for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:16.520 --> 00:45:21.160
the Ten Shadows Technique. However none of the&nbsp;
main families current family members were born&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:21.160 --> 00:45:24.600
with that inherited technique. Instead the eldest&nbsp;
and youngest males of the family, Naobito and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:24.600 --> 00:45:27.080
Naoya had a secondary inherited&nbsp;
technique, projection sorcery.

00:45:27.080 --> 00:45:33.200
(Projection Sorcery) Just like in an anime&nbsp;
sequence, movie or animation, this technique&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:33.200 --> 00:45:38.200
divides one second into twenty-four frames of&nbsp;
animation using the user's field of view as the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:38.200 --> 00:45:43.280
projection angle. To perform the ability, the user&nbsp;
will trace a predetermined set of movements that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:43.280 --> 00:45:48.960
take place over 24 frames and execute them in a&nbsp;
single second. Due to how this technique works,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:48.960 --> 00:45:52.360
it makes the user appear to move&nbsp;
unnaturally fast, too quick for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:45:52.360 --> 00:45:56.840
even special grade cursed spirits to follow,&nbsp;
however this is technically just a fallacy.

00:45:56.840 --> 00:46:00.280
While Projection Sorcery is active&nbsp;
and the sorcerer is in movement,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:00.280 --> 00:46:05.280
anything touched by the user's palm must also&nbsp;
abide by the "24 FPS" and copy those same&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:05.280 --> 00:46:09.960
movements. If the opponent doesn't follow these&nbsp;
specific rules, it results in the subject getting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:09.960 --> 00:46:15.280
immobilized and frozen in an animation frame&nbsp;
for one second. Although it's just a second,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:15.280 --> 00:46:19.280
anything caught in that frame is completely&nbsp;
vulnerable to attack, allowing people to land&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:19.280 --> 00:46:24.600
free hits. Hitting the frame will break the target&nbsp;
out of it. Catching someone in a frame wont do any&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:24.600 --> 00:46:30.280
damage in itself, so the sorcerer using this&nbsp;
ability still needs to be somewhat strong.

00:46:30.280 --> 00:46:35.320
After the user decides on their movements,&nbsp;
the predetermined course cannot be adjusted.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:35.320 --> 00:46:40.160
On top of that, if the trajectory of movement&nbsp;
or the laws of physics are excessively ignored,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:40.160 --> 00:46:44.108
the user will be frozen in a frame for one second.

00:46:44.108 --> 00:46:48.760
Ogi Zenin - Next up and brother to Naobito, Ogi&nbsp;
Zenin always thought he was unlucky and hard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:48.760 --> 00:46:53.720
done by in life. He never received the Ten Shadows&nbsp;
Technique or projection Sorcerery and was always&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:53.720 --> 00:46:58.880
outclassed by his brother. Still.. Somehow he&nbsp;
thought he was the one who deserved to be the head&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:58.880 --> 00:47:04.980
of the family, and thats why I think he decided&nbsp;
to name his Innate Technique: Blazing Courage.

00:47:04.980 --> 00:47:08.480
62(Blazing Courage) Blazing Courage allows&nbsp;
the user to ignite flames of cursed energy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:08.480 --> 00:47:12.600
and channel them through their weapon to&nbsp;
create a flaming sword. Blazing Courage&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:12.600 --> 00:47:16.680
can be used to replace a broken blade and&nbsp;
can even slice through objects as a sword&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:16.680 --> 00:47:20.280
would. If the user infuses more&nbsp;
cursed energy into the technique,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:20.280 --> 00:47:25.066
it will generate scorching flames that&nbsp;
encircle them and coat their blade.

00:47:25.066 --> 00:47:29.240
Ranta Zenin - Next up out of the people inside&nbsp;
of the Zenin Clan with some form of Technique,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:29.240 --> 00:47:33.360
so dont expect to hear about the Kukuru&nbsp;
Squad, Ranta Zenin and his Paralyzing Gaze.

00:47:33.360 --> 00:47:39.200
(Paralyzing Gaze) Pretty much from what we&nbsp;
could see, Paralyzing Gaze is an ability&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:39.200 --> 00:47:44.080
that catches anyone the user gazes upon&nbsp;
in an immobilizing aura. On top of that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:44.080 --> 00:47:48.720
large eyes that emit the Paralyzing Gaze are&nbsp;
imagined behind the opponent. These eyes work&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:48.720 --> 00:47:53.120
as an intermediary between the sorcerer and&nbsp;
opponent. So if someone manages to break the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:47:53.120 --> 00:47:58.584
hold and in turn those eyes, it could&nbsp;
backfire with devastating consequences.

00:47:58.584 --> 00:48:04.304
Jinichi Zenin - Next up out of the Zenin’s,&nbsp;
Jinichi and his massive missile fists technique.

00:48:04.304 --> 00:48:05.480
(Missile Fists) As the name implies,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:05.480 --> 00:48:09.360
Missile Fists is an extremely destructive&nbsp;
technique in which the user is able to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:09.360 --> 00:48:15.024
conjure a number of giant firsts that are&nbsp;
propelled by cursed energy, like a missile.

00:48:15.024 --> 00:48:16.960
Chojuro Zenin - Lastly out&nbsp;
of the Zenin family members,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:16.960 --> 00:48:21.227
Chojuro Zenin and his ability&nbsp;
to manipulate the earth.

00:48:21.227 --> 00:48:24.720
(Earth Arms) Chojuro's Earth Arms technique&nbsp;
allows him to manipulate the earth to some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:24.720 --> 00:48:28.640
degree. To do this, the user touches&nbsp;
the ground with both hands and activates&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:28.640 --> 00:48:33.760
the ability. From what we’ve seen, its&nbsp;
only able to create large stone hands,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:33.760 --> 00:48:38.464
but im sure there’s probably some more&nbsp;
utility to it we never got to see.

00:48:38.464 --> 00:48:43.520
Ryomen Sukuna - Moving on from the Zenin’s and&nbsp;
when it comes to the king of curses himself, it is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:43.520 --> 00:48:47.800
currently unknown what Sukuna's cursed technique&nbsp;
is called. Throughout the series he’s been shown&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:47.800 --> 00:48:52.760
to use his cursed energy to perform two types of&nbsp;
slashes. The reason we dont know if this is his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:52.760 --> 00:48:57.760
innate technique or not is because he has such&nbsp;
a high level of control over cursed energy. Most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:48:57.760 --> 00:49:02.520
characters will take days to unlock a new ability,&nbsp;
for Sukuna though all it takes is one glance at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:02.520 --> 00:49:07.200
how it was achieved to do it himself. On top of&nbsp;
the base standard slashing attacks Sukuna was seen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:07.200 --> 00:49:11.900
using, he’s also been shown to use fire-based&nbsp;
powers that originate from another dimension.

00:49:11.900 --> 00:49:16.600
(Dismantle) When it comes to the slashing attacks&nbsp;
though, Dismantle is an attack that is normally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:16.600 --> 00:49:21.600
used for inanimate objects. This attack doesn't&nbsp;
work on cursed spirits or sorcerers, unless they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:21.600 --> 00:49:28.120
are no longer considered alive. It may also work&nbsp;
on Maki as CE see’s her as an inanimate object.

00:49:28.120 --> 00:49:32.520
(Cleave) Secondary of the two slashing&nbsp;
attacks, Cleave is an attack that adjusts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:32.520 --> 00:49:38.947
the level of cursed energy needed depending on the&nbsp;
target's toughness, to cut them down in one go.

00:49:38.947 --> 00:49:42.680
(Fire Arrow) Possibly an otherworldly&nbsp;
ability or even his Innate Technique,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:42.680 --> 00:49:47.360
Fire Arrow is an ability that allows the user&nbsp;
to open some form of black box to create and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:47.360 --> 00:49:51.720
manipulate flames. These flames are then&nbsp;
formed into an arrow and shot at whoever&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:49:51.720 --> 00:49:59.280
the intended target it. Throughout the series, not&nbsp;
a single person has ever survived these flames.

00:49:59.280 --> 00:50:04.080
(Spiderweb) After gaining Megumi’s body, we&nbsp;
saw the king of curses use a multitude of new&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:50:04.080 --> 00:50:08.560
abilities that we hadn't seen him use before.&nbsp;
The first of these, Spiderweb allows the user&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:50:08.560 --> 00:50:13.960
to utilize the Cleave but in a spiderweb like&nbsp;
pattern. As a variation of Cleave, this technique&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:50:13.960 --> 00:50:19.400
can also adjust its destructive force to take out&nbsp;
the intended opponent or surroundings in one blow.

00:50:19.400 --> 00:50:23.400
When it comes to the Ten Shadows Technique,&nbsp;
Sukuna actually expanded on what we originally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:50:23.400 --> 00:50:26.680
knew was even possible. He made&nbsp;
the technique seem otherworldly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:50:26.680 --> 00:50:31.026
and even summoned other Shikigami&nbsp;
we never saw Megumi conjure up.

00:50:31.026 --> 00:50:34.520
(Piercing Ox) The first of these ancient&nbsp;
Shikigami, Piercing Ox is as the name&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:50:34.520 --> 00:50:38.920
says an ox shikigami that can charge down&nbsp;
opponents with frightening speed. Due to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:50:38.920 --> 00:50:42.960
how we’ve seen it summoned, it can only move&nbsp;
in a straight line, but the longer its charge,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:50:42.960 --> 00:50:47.040
the more powerful its hit will be. Its&nbsp;
also extremely robust and was able to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:50:47.040 --> 00:50:52.427
take a few blows from a special grade&nbsp;
Heian period sorcerer before vanishing.

00:50:52.427 --> 00:50:56.680
(Round Deer) Second is the Round Deer, this&nbsp;
beast is a towering deer shikigami that can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:50:56.680 --> 00:51:01.320
automatically heal itself and the master through&nbsp;
reverse cursed technique. The positive cursed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:51:01.320 --> 00:51:05.320
energy that flows through the Shikigami, is&nbsp;
powerful enough to cause another sorcerer to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:51:05.320 --> 00:51:10.320
lose control of whatever they might be doing.&nbsp;
Ofcourse aswell, with it being positive energy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:51:10.320 --> 00:51:16.083
and like Mahoraga id say Round Deer is a&nbsp;
great option for battling cursed spirits.

00:51:16.083 --> 00:51:18.600
(Nue: Totality - Merged Beast Agito) Lastly out of&nbsp;
the extra add in’s to the Ten Shadows Technique,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:51:21.560 --> 00:51:26.720
is an improved humanoid version of the&nbsp;
Nue. This Merged Beast Agito inherited&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:51:26.720 --> 00:51:31.680
the powers of the Great Serpent, Tiger&nbsp;
Funeral, and Round Deer. It is a large,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:51:31.680 --> 00:51:35.920
powerful shikigami capable of producing&nbsp;
electricity and regenerating lost limbs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:51:35.920 --> 00:51:42.424
with reverse cursed technique. This&nbsp;
RCT can also work on its master.

00:51:42.424 --> 00:51:44.240
(Tiger Funeral) Also I mise aswell mention it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:51:44.240 --> 00:51:49.160
but we did technically get the 10th Shikigami&nbsp;
revealed to us. Its name Tiger Funeral doesn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:51:49.160 --> 00:51:57.440
really give much away apart from the fact its&nbsp;
got something to do with a tiger. So yeah.

00:51:57.440 --> 00:52:02.423
Master Tengen - Over to the oldest lady in&nbsp;
the history of Jujutsu Kaisen, big Thumgen.

00:52:02.423 --> 00:52:04.840
(Immortality) So being the oldest&nbsp;
person in the verse, Tengen has the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:52:04.840 --> 00:52:09.880
ability of immortality. This technique&nbsp;
obviously grants the user eternal life,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:52:09.880 --> 00:52:14.360
however it does not stop the aging process.&nbsp;
In order to keep living past this point,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:52:14.360 --> 00:52:18.800
their body and technique must be&nbsp;
reset every five hundred years.

00:52:18.800 --> 00:52:26.720
Kenjaku/Noritoshi Kamo - Moving onto the previous&nbsp;
lover of Tengen and the BACKSHOT KING. Kenjaku&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:52:26.720 --> 00:52:32.624
has been around for as long, if not longer&nbsp;
because of his special ability, Body Swapping.

00:52:32.624 --> 00:52:36.280
(Body Swapping) Kenjaku's innate technique&nbsp;
allows him to swap bodies with another person,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:52:36.280 --> 00:52:41.920
even if they are dead, by transplanting his brain&nbsp;
into the body of his target. After the transplant,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:52:42.720 --> 00:52:46.800
this technique leaves a stitched scar&nbsp;
running across the users head. The user&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:52:46.800 --> 00:52:50.800
is at anytime able to remove the top part&nbsp;
of their head and reveal their true self.

00:52:51.680 --> 00:52:56.320
Once inside a body, the user of body swapping&nbsp;
will gain access to the host's cursed energy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:52:56.320 --> 00:53:00.240
all their innate techniques, and&nbsp;
memories. Even the Six Eyes wont&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:53:00.240 --> 00:53:05.320
be able recognize him as an imposter since&nbsp;
he has the original users cursed energy.

00:53:05.320 --> 00:53:09.600
As shown with his usage of Kaori technique&nbsp;
while fighting against Choso and Yuki,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:53:09.600 --> 00:53:14.240
its been hinted that even when switching to a&nbsp;
new body, a body swapping user retains access&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:53:14.240 --> 00:53:19.040
and usage of his former host’s innate cursed&nbsp;
techniques. This cant be abused to much though,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:53:19.040 --> 00:53:22.960
as the limit of former hosts innate&nbsp;
techniques the user can store is upto 4.

00:53:22.960 --> 00:53:34.840
(Antigravity System) One of these stolen innate&nbsp;
techniques from a former host, The Antigravity&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:53:34.840 --> 00:53:43.960
System is freaking broken. The exact function&nbsp;
of how Kaori Itadori’s technique worked still&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:53:43.960 --> 00:53:49.240
isn't fully explored, so its hard to exactly pin&nbsp;
down how Kenjaku’s version of it might work. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:53:49.240 --> 00:53:53.360
what we all need to understand is that what we&nbsp;
saw is him use is the Reversal of her cursed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:53:53.360 --> 00:53:58.640
technique. In theory im assuming that Kaori’s&nbsp;
Anti Gravity turned off the gravity around her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:53:58.640 --> 00:54:03.640
and allowed the user to send people shooting off&nbsp;
in some sort of vacuum. What we all saw was the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:54:03.640 --> 00:54:08.520
reversal of that where the user instead forces&nbsp;
an insane amount of gravitational forces down&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:54:08.520 --> 00:54:14.440
for approximately 6 seconds. On top of that, the&nbsp;
gravitational forces dont seem to effect the user,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:54:14.440 --> 00:54:19.640
but are able to stop the effects of pretty much&nbsp;
any ability, including a freaking black hole.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:54:19.640 --> 00:54:23.800
This ability, just because of how unknown&nbsp;
it still is seems so interesting to me,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:54:23.800 --> 00:54:28.280
and id love to see it get another feature in&nbsp;
an upcoming battle so we can find out more. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:54:28.280 --> 00:54:34.480
fact that this could be an ability Yuji might have&nbsp;
because his mum had it aswell is mental, like is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:54:34.480 --> 00:54:42.480
it possible dude could go from having no abilities&nbsp;
to just being stacked up. Id love to know your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:54:42.480 --> 00:54:47.460
thoughts on this one down below for sure and if&nbsp;
you think I miss understood it let me know haha!

00:54:47.460 --> 00:54:54.280
Uraume - Sticking with the other members&nbsp;
of Kenjaku’s squad and someone who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:54:54.280 --> 00:54:58.400
actually turned out to be Sukuna’s&nbsp;
close acquaintance. The ice Queen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:54:58.400 --> 00:55:02.880
Uraume has one of the most versatile&nbsp;
abilities in the series, Ice Formation.

00:55:02.880 --> 00:55:07.400
(Ice Formation) As you could imagine, this ice&nbsp;
based technique allows the user to lower the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:55:07.400 --> 00:55:11.560
temperature around them to extreme levels.&nbsp;
These freezing temperatures then allow them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:55:11.560 --> 00:55:16.440
to produce ice and frost at will. The user&nbsp;
can generate multiple sheets of solid ice by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:55:16.440 --> 00:55:22.000
simply touching a surface. They can also manifest&nbsp;
other forms of ice such as a cloud of frozen mist,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:55:22.000 --> 00:55:26.880
or a massive block of ice that falls from the&nbsp;
sky. Any ice or extremely cold substance can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:55:26.880 --> 00:55:30.027
also freely manipulated by the user, allowing&nbsp;
them to only use their mind to send attacks.

00:55:30.027 --> 00:55:32.200
(Frost Calm) A baseline ability of Ice formation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:55:32.200 --> 00:55:36.640
Frost Calm lowers the temperature of the air&nbsp;
around the user, allowing them to channel a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:55:36.640 --> 00:55:41.440
frosted mist to their hand. The user then brings&nbsp;
their hand up to their mouth and blows on that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:55:41.440 --> 00:55:46.640
frozen mist. This in turn creates a cloud of&nbsp;
icy mist that shoots towards their target.

00:55:46.640 --> 00:55:51.280
As the cloud of icy mist move’s forward,&nbsp;
anything that it touches instantly gets frozen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:55:51.280 --> 00:55:56.040
enabling the user to trap their opponent. While&nbsp;
trapped and covered in several layers of ice,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:55:56.040 --> 00:56:01.140
one wrong move might result in them getting cut&nbsp;
by the razer sharp icicles that now surround them.

00:56:01.140 --> 00:56:05.840
(Icefall) Just like with the previous technique,&nbsp;
Icefall allows the user to lower the temperature&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:56:05.840 --> 00:56:11.440
of air around their hand, covering it with a thin&nbsp;
layer of ice. With this extremely low temperature,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:56:11.440 --> 00:56:16.520
the Ice Formation user is able to generate&nbsp;
massive amounts of ice on any surface they touch.

00:56:16.520 --> 00:56:20.360
On top of that, the user can break apart the&nbsp;
ice using their mind and levitate it through&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:56:20.360 --> 00:56:24.920
the air. If they managed to hit their opponent,&nbsp;
the user can freeze their target on contact,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:56:24.920 --> 00:56:27.760
covering their body with&nbsp;
a thick layer of hard ice.

00:56:27.760 --> 00:56:30.400
Once trapped again, the users&nbsp;
opponents are finished off&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:56:30.400 --> 00:56:35.263
by large icicles that fly forth&nbsp;
and skewer their frozen bodies.

00:56:35.263 --> 00:56:37.880
Haruta Shigemo - Next up on the list,&nbsp;
we got the creeper king himself,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:56:37.880 --> 00:56:41.920
big Haruta Shigemo and his&nbsp;
crazy innate technique Miracles.

00:56:41.920 --> 00:56:46.080
(Miracles) I think its pretty obvious&nbsp;
here that Gege needed someone to beat on,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:56:46.880 --> 00:56:51.120
so he legit created a technique that&nbsp;
revolved around miracles. The idea for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:56:51.120 --> 00:56:55.400
this technique works by erasing all of the&nbsp;
little every day miracles one might have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:56:55.400 --> 00:56:59.480
(like seeing a clock randomly hit all the&nbsp;
same digits) along with the memory of it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:56:59.480 --> 00:57:04.920
from Haruta's life and stores them away. Once&nbsp;
stored away, these lines appear under his eyes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:57:04.920 --> 00:57:09.920
with a Maximum of 6 miracles being allowed per&nbsp;
day. These stored miracles are released when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:57:09.920 --> 00:57:15.640
Haruta's life is in danger, altering his luck&nbsp;
to ensure he survives lethal events. Finally,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:57:15.640 --> 00:57:21.425
when a miracle has been used, the marking&nbsp;
turns to white, signifying that its empty.

00:57:21.425 --> 00:57:24.880
Jiro Awasaka - Weirdly when it comes to people&nbsp;
that can take a hit head on and make it seem as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:57:24.880 --> 00:57:31.020
though they're absolutely fine after. Jiro Awasaka&nbsp;
and his Inverse technique is the perfect example.

00:57:31.020 --> 00:57:35.400
(Inverse) While activated Inverse makes it&nbsp;
so all damage attacks against the user are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:57:35.400 --> 00:57:39.600
reversed. Simply enough, strong blows&nbsp;
become weak and weak ones become strong&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:57:39.600 --> 00:57:43.680
while the technique is activated. Due to&nbsp;
how ridiculous it would be if this technique&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:57:43.680 --> 00:57:50.712
inversed everything on the user, there is a&nbsp;
minimum and maximum limit to its conditions.

00:57:50.712 --> 00:57:55.120
Ogami - Fourth and final from Kenjaku’s&nbsp;
group to have a known technique, Ogami with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:57:55.120 --> 00:58:00.860
her séance technique came into the story during&nbsp;
shibuya and absolutely flipped it on its head.

00:58:00.860 --> 00:58:04.440
(Séance Technique) The Séance Technique grants&nbsp;
the user the ability to contact the dead and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:58:04.440 --> 00:58:09.080
summon their body or soul's information to the&nbsp;
living world. This is done by having someone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:58:09.080 --> 00:58:14.560
consume apart of a deceased sorcerer, while&nbsp;
the user performs a ritual. Transforming into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:58:14.560 --> 00:58:19.680
someone using their body's information allows the&nbsp;
shape-shifter to utilize their physical abilities.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:58:19.680 --> 00:58:24.360
The technique is supposed to signal its own end&nbsp;
when the shape-shifter's cursed energy runs out,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:58:24.360 --> 00:58:29.743
however there can be complications&nbsp;
if the wrong person is resurrected.

00:58:29.743 --> 00:58:34.440
Hajime Kashimo - Once we entered the culling game,&nbsp;
Mr Gege Akutami decided to introduce a flurry of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:58:34.440 --> 00:58:39.080
new characters that have some of the most exciting&nbsp;
cursed techniques seen yet. One of these guys&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:58:39.080 --> 00:58:44.880
and probably the strongest re-incarnation, Hajime&nbsp;
Kashimo had a one use innate technique that would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:58:44.880 --> 00:58:49.440
subsequently end his life once it finishes.&nbsp;
To enable himself to fight without having to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:58:49.440 --> 00:58:54.720
rely on this technique, the ancient sorcerer took&nbsp;
advantage of his unique electrified cursed energy.

00:58:54.720 --> 00:58:59.160
(Lightning Discharge) A side effect of his&nbsp;
cursed energy, so its not really a cursed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:58:59.160 --> 00:59:03.520
technique, but Lightning Discharge works by&nbsp;
applying a positive charge to his target,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:59:03.520 --> 00:59:07.880
the user is then able to discharge the negative&nbsp;
charge without having any of that electricity hit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:59:07.880 --> 00:59:12.360
the ground. In turn this creates a powerful&nbsp;
lightning like ability that cuts through the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:59:12.360 --> 00:59:16.920
sky and is almost guaranteed to anyone in its&nbsp;
way. The only way they’d actually dodge is if&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:59:16.920 --> 00:59:21.360
they could physically move faster than&nbsp;
lightning though, so its fairly lethal.

00:59:21.360 --> 00:59:29.240
(Mythical Beast Amber) When it comes to his one&nbsp;
time use innate technique, Mythical Beast Amber,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:59:29.240 --> 00:59:33.640
it is a release technique that reconstructs the&nbsp;
users body in order to bring forth any effect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:59:33.640 --> 00:59:39.680
that can be created by electricity. Once activated&nbsp;
it cant be deactivated and will use up all of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:59:39.680 --> 00:59:44.720
cursed energy that user had, as the users body&nbsp;
will evolve into something far beyond the human&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:59:44.720 --> 00:59:50.120
form. There isn't any specific extension ability&nbsp;
connected with this attack, just side effects.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:59:50.120 --> 00:59:54.960
These side effects increase the brains activity&nbsp;
making it work faster, optimize sound and tuning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:59:54.960 --> 01:00:01.382
waves to match normal frequencies and vaporize&nbsp;
irradiated objects using electromagnetic waves.

01:00:01.382 --> 01:00:05.560
Hiromi Higuruma - Next up we’ve got the actual&nbsp;
G himself and Yuji’s new right hand battle man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:00:05.560 --> 01:00:09.760
Hiromi Higuruma and his innate&nbsp;
technique Deadly Sentencing.

01:00:13.720 --> 01:00:20.720
(Deadly Sentencing) Since Deadly Sentencing is&nbsp;
linked to the users Domain Expansion by default&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:00:20.720 --> 01:00:25.480
ill just slightly mention it. If you want more&nbsp;
ill make a video going over every known Domain&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:00:25.480 --> 01:00:29.760
Expansion, binding vow and ive already done&nbsp;
barrier techniques if you wanna check that out&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:00:30.520 --> 01:00:35.760
here! Either way, Deadly Sentencing manifests a&nbsp;
small courtroom domain surrounded by guillotines&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:00:35.760 --> 01:00:40.040
where the user and their opponent are placed&nbsp;
on podiums standing across from one other. This&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:00:40.040 --> 01:00:44.680
domain does not use a guaranteed hit, instead,&nbsp;
anyone inside is simply forced to follow its&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:00:44.680 --> 01:00:50.120
rules. Following with the law type theme of his&nbsp;
domain, it also incorporates a Shikigami known as&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:00:50.120 --> 01:00:55.240
Judgeman, who obviously takes that judge roll. As&nbsp;
it may suggest, Deadly Sentencing is a court based&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:00:55.240 --> 01:00:59.960
technique where the target is placed on a stand&nbsp;
and interrogated. If found guilty they could face&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:00:59.960 --> 01:01:05.106
a multitude of different consequences,&nbsp;
with the worst being the death penalty.

01:01:05.106 --> 01:01:10.294
Hana Kurusu - On a lighter note and someone who’s&nbsp;
able to rid the darkness from peoples hearts.

01:01:10.294 --> 01:01:13.680
(Technique Nullification) Hana Kurusu is able&nbsp;
to wield Angel's innate technique, known as&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:01:13.680 --> 01:01:19.200
nullification. Pretty much, this technique is&nbsp;
able nullify any and all curses, including cursed&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:01:19.200 --> 01:01:24.480
techniques, barriers and seals. In addition, the&nbsp;
user might be able to revert incarnated humans&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:01:24.480 --> 01:01:28.880
whose bodies have been fused with cursed objects,&nbsp;
back to their original state. There are a lot of&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:01:28.880 --> 01:01:33.840
complications with this though, and it would most&nbsp;
likely result in the original vessels body dying.

01:01:33.840 --> 01:01:38.720
(Maximum Output Technique: Jacobs Ladder) When&nbsp;
it comes to Hana’s Maximum Output Technique:&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:01:38.720 --> 01:01:43.800
Jacobs Ladder. This ability conjures a four-winged&nbsp;
trumpet made of light under the users mouth,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:01:43.800 --> 01:01:48.520
then an enormous magic circle of light in&nbsp;
the sky above the users head. This magical&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:01:48.520 --> 01:01:53.000
circle then features a large heptagram or&nbsp;
7 pointed star in its middle and crosses&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:01:53.000 --> 01:01:57.320
along its outer edge. Upon sounding the&nbsp;
trumpet, the user creates a beam of light&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:01:57.320 --> 01:02:01.240
that shoots down from the middle of the&nbsp;
circle to engulf whatever is below. Any&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:02:01.240 --> 01:02:05.680
cursed technique will be "extinguished" under&nbsp;
the light, and incarnation is also susceptible,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:02:05.680 --> 01:02:09.418
as proven when Sukuna's host body&nbsp;
started corroding upon being struck.

01:02:09.418 --> 01:02:22.520
Fumihiko Takaba - Ahh the LEGEND, BIG FUMIHIKO&nbsp;
TAKABA and his insane innate technique Comedian.

01:02:22.520 --> 01:02:28.120
(Comedian) This technique is freaking broken,&nbsp;
So in short it allows the user to manifest&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:02:28.120 --> 01:02:42.120
whatever they think is funny into reality. The&nbsp;
effects of this technique cover a wide variety,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:02:42.120 --> 01:02:47.800
including but not being limited to: conjuring&nbsp;
objects or substances from nothing, healing&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:02:47.800 --> 01:02:52.400
themselves without the use of Reverse Cursed&nbsp;
Technique, and nullifying damage done to them.

01:02:52.400 --> 01:02:55.280
Despite the extraordinary power&nbsp;
granted by this technique,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:02:55.280 --> 01:02:59.120
Comedian can only be activated if the&nbsp;
user remains confident and certain in&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:02:59.120 --> 01:03:03.680
their ability to be funny. As a result, if&nbsp;
the user loses confidence in their humor,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:03.680 --> 01:03:07.432
the technique will be deactivated and&nbsp;
render them vulnerable to attacks.

01:03:07.432 --> 01:03:12.184
Hanyu - Time for the Hair extension&nbsp;
cursed technique users, Hanyu and Haba

01:03:12.184 --> 01:03:15.720
(Airplane Hair) Hanyu's cursed technique&nbsp;
Airplane hair changes the users hair into&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:15.720 --> 01:03:19.040
the shape of a jet plane with 2 boosters&nbsp;
strong enough to propel someone through&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:19.040 --> 01:03:27.400
the air at high-speed. Other sections&nbsp;
of a Airplane Hair users body are less&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:27.400 --> 01:03:32.422
protected by cursed energy and therefore&nbsp;
vulnerable while the technique is active.

01:03:32.422 --> 01:03:36.280
(Helicopter Hair) Just like Hanyu, Haba's cursed&nbsp;
technique, Helicopter Hair changed his hair into&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:36.280 --> 01:03:41.320
a propeller with four blades. By activating it,&nbsp;
a user of Helicopter hair can fly around and&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:41.320 --> 01:03:46.280
suspend themselves in the air with ease. They’re&nbsp;
also able to adjust the length and angle of their&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:46.280 --> 01:03:51.200
propellers, as well as increase its rotational&nbsp;
speed and toughness. Like Hanyu, it is likely that&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:51.200 --> 01:03:55.720
Haba's cursed energy is mainly focused on his hair&nbsp;
making him susceptible to body attacks aswell.

01:03:55.720 --> 01:03:59.960
Remi - I actually completely forgot&nbsp;
to add this person in to start with,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:59.960 --> 01:04:03.320
so luckily on a second check through I remembered&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:04:03.320 --> 01:04:07.344
that Remi is actually apart of this hair&nbsp;
manipulation gang with her scorpion hair.

01:04:07.344 --> 01:04:11.080
(Scorpion Hair) Remi's technique Scorpion&nbsp;
Hair allows the user manipulate their hair&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:04:11.080 --> 01:04:16.200
into a scorpion like tail that can attack their&nbsp;
opponents. Sadly for users of this technique,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:04:16.200 --> 01:04:21.060
it seems to be extremely weak. However that was&nbsp;
probably just due to Remi’s lack of cursed energy.

01:04:21.060 --> 01:04:26.560
Reggie Star - Following the hair manipulators&nbsp;
we’ve got the man who’s able to dupe the absolute&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:04:26.560 --> 01:04:30.440
hell out of any receipts he finds. No need&nbsp;
to buy anything when you’ve got Reggie Star&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:04:30.440 --> 01:04:34.135
and his Contractual Recreation technique&nbsp;
to just make it out of thin air for you!

01:04:34.135 --> 01:04:38.360
(Contractual Recreation) As the name suggests,&nbsp;
contractual recreation uses contracts such as&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:04:38.360 --> 01:04:43.480
receipts to produce anything written on them.&nbsp;
This manifests the main or most expensive item&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:04:43.480 --> 01:04:47.320
off of those receipts. It can produce&nbsp;
pretty much anything written on them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:04:47.320 --> 01:04:52.280
but from we’ve seen, tend to be items or&nbsp;
services. An item could be anything from&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:04:52.280 --> 01:04:57.320
a TV to an axe, whereas a service might&nbsp;
be a getaway retreat or spa vacation that&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:04:57.320 --> 01:05:00.920
the user could instantly activate&nbsp;
and take the healing effects from.

01:05:00.920 --> 01:05:05.120
Things the user re-creates sort of act&nbsp;
like a Shikigami with given commands.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:05:05.120 --> 01:05:08.000
For example if someone summons&nbsp;
a few missiles with a receipt,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:05:08.000 --> 01:05:12.080
they can be ordered with their mind to do&nbsp;
a certain action. After they finish this&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:05:12.080 --> 01:05:15.920
action though, that summoning will&nbsp;
disappear and no longer be usable.

01:05:15.920 --> 01:05:20.280
In order to activate Contractual Re-Creation,&nbsp;
the user must apply their cursed energy to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:05:20.280 --> 01:05:24.800
the contract or receipt and burn it. The&nbsp;
downside to this technique is that water&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:05:24.800 --> 01:05:28.280
heavily de-buffs the sorcerer. If they&nbsp;
happen to get any of the receipts wet,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:05:28.280 --> 01:05:32.411
then it will be almost impossible&nbsp;
to ignite them with cursed energy.

01:05:32.411 --> 01:05:34.520
Iori Hazenoki - Number 2, or who im&nbsp;
assuming could be considered the second&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:05:34.520 --> 01:05:38.520
strongest sorcerer inside of Reggie’s&nbsp;
group, Iori Hazenoki is an extremely&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:05:38.520 --> 01:05:41.960
durable character who only recently&nbsp;
kicked the bucked thanks to Kenjaku.

01:05:42.480 --> 01:05:50.840
(Explosive Flesh) Hazenoki's innate&nbsp;
technique Explosive Flesh allows him&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:05:50.840 --> 01:05:55.800
to remotely detonate his own body parts and&nbsp;
use them as bombs. To do this a user of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:05:55.800 --> 01:05:59.680
Explosive Flesh technique can remove parts&nbsp;
of their body and throw them as projectiles&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:05:59.680 --> 01:06:04.080
that will explode on command. To stop a user&nbsp;
of this ability running out of limbs before&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:04.080 --> 01:06:07.480
they even make it out of pre-school,&nbsp;
a reversed cursed technique to replace&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:07.480 --> 01:06:12.865
the lost body parts makes it simple for a&nbsp;
user of this ability to regrow anything.

01:06:12.865 --> 01:06:16.840
Chizuru Hari - Most forgettable&nbsp;
from Reggie’s group, just due to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:16.840 --> 01:06:20.160
how quickly Megumi dunked on this&nbsp;
dude, Chizuru Hari has probably one&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:20.160 --> 01:06:24.000
of the most useless techniques that make&nbsp;
an appearance during the culling game.

01:06:24.000 --> 01:06:28.560
(Claws) Chizuru's technique Claws allows&nbsp;
him to shift his fingers into dark claws.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:28.560 --> 01:06:32.800
Its hard to say if the offensive side to&nbsp;
this ability had any effect while fighting,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:32.800 --> 01:06:35.960
as the dude really never got to show&nbsp;
it off. Pretty much all we got to see&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:35.960 --> 01:06:39.680
was that users of this ability can&nbsp;
also climb walls using their claws.

01:06:39.680 --> 01:06:46.480
Ryu Ishigori - Finally someone with a little&nbsp;
bit of potency again. The LEGEND himself and&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:46.480 --> 01:06:52.214
man with the largest cursed energy output&nbsp;
in the entire culling game, Ryu Ishigori.

01:06:52.214 --> 01:06:56.000
(Cursed Energy Discharge) Ryu’s Technique, Cursed&nbsp;
Energy Discharge is a pretty straightforward&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:56.000 --> 01:07:00.480
technique. It allows the user to discharge&nbsp;
directed beams of compressed cursed energy&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:00.480 --> 01:07:05.320
like a cannon. In order to fire, the blast has&nbsp;
to be charged up in order to build up a larger&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:05.320 --> 01:07:10.000
enough concentration of cursed energy into a&nbsp;
single point. The strength of the outputted&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:10.000 --> 01:07:15.240
blast depends on how much time was allowed for&nbsp;
it to build up. Then finally once it does fire,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:15.240 --> 01:07:19.880
the beams can take several forms depending&nbsp;
on the user's desires. For example, cursed&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:19.880 --> 01:07:24.040
energy can be fired as a full power blast&nbsp;
capable of decimating several city blocks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:24.040 --> 01:07:28.824
or a volley of rapid fire blasts&nbsp;
to take out the user's target.

01:07:28.824 --> 01:07:33.160
(Granite Blast) Granite Blast is the most powerful&nbsp;
and straightforward application of cursed energy&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:33.160 --> 01:07:38.440
discharge. It is a long ranged, extremely powerful&nbsp;
blast wave of highly concentrated cursed energy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:38.440 --> 01:07:42.440
that can easily destroy an entire city&nbsp;
block. The more cursed energy that is&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:42.440 --> 01:07:47.787
charged into Granite Blast, the larger&nbsp;
and more deadly its attack range becomes.

01:07:47.787 --> 01:07:52.480
Takako Uro - Next up we’ve got the series longest&nbsp;
living hater and someone who just cant let things&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:52.480 --> 01:07:58.200
go, Takako Uro and her Sky Manipulation Technique.&nbsp;
(its been like 400 years and first thing she does&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:58.200 --> 01:08:02.680
each time she see’s some strong dude is&nbsp;
accuse them of being a Fujiwara scumbag)

01:08:03.587 --> 01:08:08.920
(Sky Manipulation) Either way! Takako's technique&nbsp;
grants her the ability to "control the sky",&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:08:08.920 --> 01:08:14.520
hence Sky Manipulation. A user of this ability&nbsp;
can turn the sky into a tangible surface and use&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:08:14.520 --> 01:08:20.360
it to manipulate space, similar to how a lens&nbsp;
creates distortion. Im gonna chuck this in here&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:08:21.560 --> 01:08:30.200
cause I think it helps with understanding the&nbsp;
technique some more. Distortion commonly occurs&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:08:30.200 --> 01:08:35.400
from deviations or anomalies near the edges of an&nbsp;
image. Each type of distortion usually develops&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:08:35.400 --> 01:08:40.040
through different variables. Barrel distortion,&nbsp;
for example, is often the result of a lens at&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:08:40.040 --> 01:08:45.120
full zoom, while pincushion distortion&nbsp;
occurs most often from telephoto lenses.

01:08:45.120 --> 01:08:47.680
A user of Sky Manipulation can casually uses it&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:08:47.680 --> 01:08:52.360
to levitate themselves and hide behind&nbsp;
portions of manipulated sky. In battle,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:08:52.360 --> 01:08:57.741
a user can defend themselves by distorting the&nbsp;
shape of the sky around their opponent's attacks.

01:08:57.741 --> 01:09:01.000
(Thin Ice Breaker) The surfaces a sky&nbsp;
manipulator controls can't crush anyone&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:09:01.000 --> 01:09:05.080
directly, so instead a user can break&nbsp;
the surface of the sky with an attack&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:09:05.080 --> 01:09:09.160
called Thin Ice Breaker. This ability&nbsp;
creates a shattering effect that cracks&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:09:09.160 --> 01:09:14.942
the surface of the sky like thin ice and hits&nbsp;
the target with some form of multiplied force.

01:09:14.942 --> 01:09:17.320
Charles Bernard - Last out of the new&nbsp;
culling game players who were introduced,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:09:17.320 --> 01:09:21.360
and someone who is, in my opinion&nbsp;
a Gege Akutami self insert,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:09:21.360 --> 01:09:26.507
Charles Bernard and his Manga&nbsp;
styled technique, G Warstaff.

01:09:26.507 --> 01:09:35.520
(G Warstaff) Okay so the G Warstaff is actually&nbsp;
a cursed tool that is tied directly to Charles’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:09:35.520 --> 01:09:42.280
innate technique. Due to him being a&nbsp;
mangaka, the item is a long spear with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:09:42.280 --> 01:09:46.360
pen-shaped tip. By hitting their opponent&nbsp;
and getting some blood on the pens tip,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:09:46.360 --> 01:09:51.040
a user of this technique can fulfill the condition&nbsp;
for "ink". After which, they can use that ink to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:09:51.040 --> 01:09:56.360
mark their opponent with a manga panel. This panel&nbsp;
is taken directly from 1 seconds in the future,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:09:56.360 --> 01:10:01.800
allowing the user to see their opponents upcoming&nbsp;
actions. If a user of G war staff can draw more&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:10:01.800 --> 01:10:07.344
blood from their opponent, then it will increase&nbsp;
the amount of time they can peer into the future.

01:10:07.344 --> 01:10:10.200
Kechizu &amp; Eso - Moving on now from the&nbsp;
techniques that were introduced to us&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:10:10.200 --> 01:10:14.800
through-out the culling game, along with just&nbsp;
sorcerers in general. In this last section we&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:10:14.800 --> 01:10:20.000
will delve into all of the techniques seen from&nbsp;
cursed spirits so far inside of Jujutsu Kaisen.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:10:20.000 --> 01:10:25.440
Also im pretty sure that only special grade&nbsp;
and the death paintings have cursed techniques,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:10:25.440 --> 01:10:30.120
so this list isn't nearly as large as the human&nbsp;
side of things. Starting things off though,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:10:30.120 --> 01:10:35.464
and just due to them sharing a bunch of&nbsp;
techniques, is brothers Eso and Kechizu.

01:10:35.464 --> 01:10:39.280
(Rot Technique) So both Eso and Kechizu&nbsp;
possessed the Rot Technique. This ability&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:10:39.280 --> 01:10:44.680
plays on the curses dark and toxic blood. Simply,&nbsp;
it is poisonous to humans and corrodes anything&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:10:44.680 --> 01:10:50.200
it touches, capable of burning skin on impact and&nbsp;
eating away at solid rock. This here is probably&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:10:50.200 --> 01:10:54.520
due to their half human side being from the Kamo&nbsp;
clan and having that affinity in their blood.

01:10:58.760 --> 01:11:01.400
Additionally, utilizing the&nbsp;
Rot Technique also grants the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:11:01.400 --> 01:11:05.280
user the ability to manipulate their&nbsp;
blood in various ways. The blood can&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:11:05.280 --> 01:11:09.680
be shaped into weapons or used to poison&nbsp;
someone and decay their body over time.

01:11:09.680 --> 01:11:14.240
(Decay) Speaking of Decay, Decay was a&nbsp;
technique both of the brothers possessed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:11:14.240 --> 01:11:18.120
This ability creates a floral pattern on&nbsp;
the target that quickly beings eating away&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:11:18.120 --> 01:11:22.640
at their body. Anyone who takes in the blood&nbsp;
of a Rot Technique user through membranes or&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:11:22.640 --> 01:11:27.560
wounds can be effected with this technique. This&nbsp;
can also spread to other people if accidentally&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:11:27.560 --> 01:11:34.379
touched. Sorcerers afflicted by this are said&nbsp;
to be killed in less than fifteen minutes.

01:11:34.379 --> 01:11:37.920
(Maximum: Wing King) Last of the cursed wombs&nbsp;
known techniques, Rot Technique Maximum:&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:11:37.920 --> 01:11:42.200
Wing King which was only seen from Eso,&nbsp;
manipulates the user's blood and shapes&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:11:42.200 --> 01:11:46.480
it into large wasp-like wings. These wings&nbsp;
can be used to create paths made of blood&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:11:46.480 --> 01:11:51.000
which can be used for offensive purposes or to&nbsp;
increase the user's maneuverability. When the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:11:51.000 --> 01:11:54.320
lines of blood connect with their target,&nbsp;
they're instantly burned by the corrosive&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:11:54.320 --> 01:11:59.550
effects of the blood. This in turn will&nbsp;
afflict them with the Decay technique.

01:11:59.550 --> 01:12:01.680
Ganesha - When it comes to&nbsp;
the special grade curses,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:12:01.680 --> 01:12:06.520
some of them have the most complex abilities&nbsp;
in the series. One of those curses, Ganesha&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:12:06.520 --> 01:12:10.861
has a technique that is able to target&nbsp;
concepts itself, whatever that means.

01:12:10.861 --> 01:12:13.600
(Obstacle Removal) Just due to how short&nbsp;
of a time the curse was in the story,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:12:13.600 --> 01:12:18.720
the ins and outs of how Obstacle Removal work&nbsp;
isn't exactly known. Kenjaku described Ganesha’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:12:18.720 --> 01:12:23.720
ability as the power to remove obstacles&nbsp;
and target concepts. So im assuming that&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:12:23.720 --> 01:12:28.320
the curse itself is probably able to remove&nbsp;
anything from an area and place it another.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:12:28.320 --> 01:12:33.480
Along with targeting the idea or concept behind&nbsp;
a cursed technique. For example Kenjaku had the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:12:33.480 --> 01:12:38.800
curse use its removal ability to remove a bunch of&nbsp;
dudes blocking his path in the white house. Then&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:12:38.800 --> 01:12:43.480
in its battle against Yuki the curse tried to&nbsp;
target and remove the concept of her technique,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:12:43.480 --> 01:12:48.187
however the overwhelming mass was too&nbsp;
much and the curse failed to do so.

01:12:48.187 --> 01:12:50.920
Kurourushi - Second of the known&nbsp;
special grade curses in the list,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:12:50.920 --> 01:12:55.299
Kurourushi the cockroach is&nbsp;
an utterly terrifying force.

01:12:55.299 --> 01:12:58.440
(Cursed Cockroaches) Kurourushi’s cursed&nbsp;
technique cursed cockroaches can produce&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:12:58.440 --> 01:13:02.320
and manipulate countless swarms of real&nbsp;
cockroaches reinforced by its cursed&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:13:02.320 --> 01:13:05.880
energy. These man-eating cockroaches&nbsp;
are able to strip the flesh off a&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:13:05.880 --> 01:13:09.800
group of humans in a matter of seconds.&nbsp;
Doing this actually feeds Kurourushi's&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:13:09.800 --> 01:13:14.580
endless appetite and in turn stimulates&nbsp;
his extension technique parthenogenesis.

01:13:14.580 --> 01:13:19.640
(Parthenogenesis) Kurourushi’s parthenogenesis&nbsp;
process, grants the curse spirit the ability to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:13:19.640 --> 01:13:24.920
produce even more cockroaches. On top of that the&nbsp;
cursed spirit can use this process to reproduce an&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:13:24.920 --> 01:13:30.000
identical yet entirely new cursed spirit, however&nbsp;
in order to preserve the original cockroaches&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:35.656
existence, the cursed energy from the parent is&nbsp;
passed on to the child when it died as so on.

01:13:35.656 --> 01:13:39.400
(Earthen Insect Trance) Last of the cockroaches&nbsp;
known techniques, Earthen Insect Trance allows the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:13:39.400 --> 01:13:43.800
cursed spirit to conjure up flying insects that&nbsp;
carry large sacs filled with a liquid substance&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:13:43.800 --> 01:13:48.480
that gets released when destroyed. If the curse&nbsp;
spirits opponent gets to sloppy when taking one&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:13:48.480 --> 01:13:54.440
out and the substance gets into the target's&nbsp;
eyes, it will start to impair their vision.

01:13:54.440 --> 01:13:58.960
Smallpox Deity - Third out&nbsp;
of the known special grades,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:13:58.960 --> 01:14:04.297
Smallpox Deity is one of the stronger curses&nbsp;
inside of Kenjaku’s storage of cursed spirits.

01:14:04.297 --> 01:14:07.800
(Gravestone Technique) Smallpox Deity's cursed&nbsp;
technique Gravestone begins when it traps&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:14:07.800 --> 01:14:12.760
its target inside a cramped coffin. After the&nbsp;
target is caught, the curse takes its left fist&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:14:12.760 --> 01:14:17.680
and lowers it into its right hand. This motion&nbsp;
drops a giant gravestone on top of the coffin,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:14:17.680 --> 01:14:22.160
dealing heavy damage and burying the coffin&nbsp;
underground. Once the gravestone is placed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:14:22.800 --> 01:14:27.000
the disease curse begins to countdown&nbsp;
from three. If the count reaches one,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:14:27.000 --> 01:14:30.000
the target will be infected with smallpox and die.

01:14:30.760 --> 01:14:39.480
Dagon - Fourth and first of the disaster&nbsp;
curses, Dagon is one of the main threats that&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:14:39.480 --> 01:14:42.720
make their appearance during Shibuya.&nbsp;
If it wasn't for Toji showing up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:14:42.720 --> 01:14:46.320
its likely that a few of the main group&nbsp;
could have died fighting this curse.

01:14:46.320 --> 01:14:51.120
(Disaster Tides) Its technique Disaster&nbsp;
Tides allows the user to manifest high&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:14:51.120 --> 01:14:55.040
volumes of water and control it using&nbsp;
their cursed energy. It can be used as&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:14:55.040 --> 01:14:59.360
a water shield for close and mid-range, and&nbsp;
as a large, sweeping wave for long-range.

01:15:00.400 --> 01:15:04.800
Its efficiency is dependent upon the cursed&nbsp;
energy of the user and for that reason,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:15:04.800 --> 01:15:10.271
can only be utilized to its full potential by&nbsp;
someone adept in cursed energy manipulation.

01:15:10.271 --> 01:15:13.840
Hanami - Weakest out of the Disaster&nbsp;
Curses, but still special grade ranked,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:15:15.160 --> 01:15:21.422
Hanami is equipped with a range of abilities that&nbsp;
if not taken seriously will deal serious damage.

01:15:21.422 --> 01:15:24.160
(Disaster Plants) Hanami’s innate technique,&nbsp;
Disaster Plants allows the user to form and&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:15:24.160 --> 01:15:28.440
control a variety of cursed fauna. Its&nbsp;
abilities are normally initiated with&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:15:28.440 --> 01:15:33.797
ones mind by activating the technique next to&nbsp;
the intended target or on the user themselves.

01:15:33.797 --> 01:15:33.880
The plants created by this technique can&nbsp;
vary in size, shape and make up. Anything&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:15:33.880 --> 01:15:34.880
from simple flowers to giant wooden roots are all&nbsp;
things possible to be formed. All of the plants&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:15:34.880 --> 01:15:37.760
that make up Disaster Plants&nbsp;
are made from cursed energy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:15:37.760 --> 01:15:42.000
meaning that all creations can be&nbsp;
constructed and deactivated instantly.

01:15:42.000 --> 01:15:45.880
The technique also grants the user the&nbsp;
ability to absorb the life energy from&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:15:45.880 --> 01:15:50.280
real plants. They can then take that&nbsp;
energy, turn it into a sort of flower&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:15:50.280 --> 01:15:54.560
offering and finally convert it into&nbsp;
cursed energy that the user can then use.

01:15:54.560 --> 01:15:59.520
(Roots) One of the main extension techniques,&nbsp;
Roots, can create large tree roots that emerge&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:15:59.520 --> 01:16:04.360
from the ground at will. If Hanami decides&nbsp;
to limit the reach and numbers of roots made,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:16:04.360 --> 01:16:09.000
the overall power and speed of the other roots&nbsp;
will increase. Obviously this works both ways&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:16:09.000 --> 01:16:13.840
and the user can also greatly expand&nbsp;
the number of roots and their range,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:16:13.840 --> 01:16:17.786
at the sacrifice of speed and destructive power.

01:16:17.786 --> 01:16:21.360
(Wooden Ball) As the name says, Wooden&nbsp;
Ball allows Hanami to create a single&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:16:21.360 --> 01:16:24.840
or multiple wooden balls from cursed&nbsp;
energy. These wooden balls will then&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:16:24.840 --> 01:16:29.280
shoot out one or two sharp branch attacks&nbsp;
in an attempt to skewer their target. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:16:29.280 --> 01:16:34.267
disaster curse is also able to use&nbsp;
these to suspend herself in midair.

01:16:34.267 --> 01:16:38.000
(Cursed Bud) The cursed bud is an attack that&nbsp;
launches flowers buds that feed on the cursed&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:16:38.000 --> 01:16:42.800
energy of whoever it attaches to. The more&nbsp;
techniques someone afflicted with a bud uses,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:16:42.800 --> 01:16:45.680
the deeper the buds roots will&nbsp;
extend into their bodies feeding&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:16:45.680 --> 01:16:50.360
off more cursed energy. These is also&nbsp;
the option of spawning a large flower&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:16:50.360 --> 01:16:53.080
that can shoot off a massive&nbsp;
barrage of these cursed buds.

01:16:53.080 --> 01:16:58.400
(Flower Field) The last technique we saw Hanami&nbsp;
use, Flower Fields, as the name would suggest can&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:16:58.400 --> 01:17:03.000
create a circle of flowers around their opponents&nbsp;
that distracts them with an effect that removes&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:17:03.000 --> 01:17:07.880
their will to fight. Hanami was also able to&nbsp;
use this technique remotely, by launching a&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:17:07.880 --> 01:17:12.720
long range projectile that the ability activated&nbsp;
off. The only downside to this ability is that&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:17:12.720 --> 01:17:19.153
if its user is weakened then Flower Field wont&nbsp;
be as effective at removing the will to fight.

01:17:19.153 --> 01:17:24.120
Jogo - Possibly the strongest out of the disaster&nbsp;
curses, Goatjo or Jogoat is equipped with a few&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:17:24.120 --> 01:17:29.222
techniques that would put pretty much any&nbsp;
sorcerer apart from Gojo on the back foot.

01:17:29.222 --> 01:17:32.360
(Disaster Flames) The curses innate&nbsp;
technique, Disaster Flames allows the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:17:32.360 --> 01:17:36.960
user to form and control both fire and&nbsp;
lava. The flames are immensely powerful,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:17:36.960 --> 01:17:41.240
capable of instantly killing non-sorcerers&nbsp;
and critically injuring sorcerers. These&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:17:41.240 --> 01:17:46.080
flames are visible to non-sorcerers and&nbsp;
possess properties similar to real flames.

01:17:46.080 --> 01:17:50.880
The technique also grants the user the ability&nbsp;
to telepathically create miniature volcanoes on&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:17:50.880 --> 01:17:57.584
any surface. These volcanoes are capable of firing&nbsp;
powerful lava towards the user's intended target.

01:17:57.584 --> 01:18:00.240
(Ember Insects) One of the first&nbsp;
techniques we saw a curse use in&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:18:00.240 --> 01:18:04.920
the story, Ember Insects allows Jogo to&nbsp;
summon small flying insect-like curses&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:18:04.920 --> 01:18:08.960
from the volcanic opening in his head.&nbsp;
These curses had a large stingers that&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:18:08.960 --> 01:18:14.052
produced a loud noise upon impact before&nbsp;
detonating into a flaming explosion.

01:18:14.052 --> 01:18:18.160
(Maximum Technique: Meteor) Jogo's Maximum&nbsp;
Technique, Meteor generates a gigantic flaming&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:18:18.160 --> 01:18:23.480
meteor that the user is able to hurl at their&nbsp;
target. The meteors size probably depends entirely&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:18:23.480 --> 01:18:28.360
on how much cursed energy the curse is willing&nbsp;
to put into the attack. If this attack lands,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:18:28.360 --> 01:18:32.720
the impact it causes is on a whole new&nbsp;
level in terms of destructive force in&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:18:32.720 --> 01:18:37.240
Jujutsu kaisen. It without question will&nbsp;
destroy entire sections of a city and is&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:18:37.240 --> 01:18:42.040
even strong enough to wound a 15 finger Sukuna.&nbsp;
Knowing what I know now about Sukuna though,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:18:42.040 --> 01:18:46.760
im questioning if he was just gassing Jogoat&nbsp;
up or not. Love to know your thoughts on it&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:18:46.760 --> 01:18:52.351
below. Either way I think this is what&nbsp;
makes him the most potent disaster curse.

01:18:52.351 --> 01:18:56.800
Mahito - Getting towards the end&nbsp;
of this video now and on the final&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:18:56.800 --> 01:19:01.657
of the four Disaster Curses, we have&nbsp;
the maniacal maniac himself, Mahito.

01:19:01.657 --> 01:19:05.560
(Idle Transfiguration) As you all probably know,&nbsp;
this dude was equipped with Idle Transfiguration,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:19:05.560 --> 01:19:10.280
one of the most broken abilities in shounen.&nbsp;
Imagine if he was good fr, dude could've&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:19:10.280 --> 01:19:16.080
healed a hospital of kids. So Idle Transfiguration&nbsp;
allows the user to reshape the soul of themselves&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:19:16.080 --> 01:19:20.960
or anyone they physically touch. The shape of&nbsp;
the body is dependent on the shape of the soul,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:19:20.960 --> 01:19:26.200
so if the soul is distorted they body will&nbsp;
also distort. Therefore, someone using Idle&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:19:26.200 --> 01:19:30.880
Transfiguration can disfigure their target's body&nbsp;
into hellish creature by warping their soul's&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:19:30.880 --> 01:19:36.440
shape with just a touch. This process creates&nbsp;
what are known as "Transfigured Humans" The&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:19:36.440 --> 01:19:41.040
only way to block this technique is by being&nbsp;
physically built differently. Weak sorcerers&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:19:41.040 --> 01:19:46.780
stand absolutely no chance and even grade 1&nbsp;
sorcerers will transfigure after a touch or 2.

01:19:46.780 --> 01:19:49.400
(Soul Multiplicity) First of&nbsp;
Mahito's created techniques,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:19:49.400 --> 01:19:54.120
Soul Multiplicity which is kinda like a base&nbsp;
technique that others work off, combines two&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:19:54.120 --> 01:19:58.960
or more souls using Idle Transfiguration. By&nbsp;
slamming these two souls together it creates&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:19:58.960 --> 01:20:03.640
a reaction due to the un-natural course&nbsp;
of soul-fusion taking place. This here&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:20:03.640 --> 01:20:09.267
as I mentioned allows the user to derive more&nbsp;
techniques that take advantage of the reaction.

01:20:09.267 --> 01:20:13.360
(Body Repel) One of these extension techniques,&nbsp;
Body Repel takes advantage of Soul Multiplicity’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:20:13.360 --> 01:20:17.360
reaction. By increasing the energy of&nbsp;
the souls associated with this effect,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:20:17.360 --> 01:20:22.760
the user can generate an overwhelming wave&nbsp;
of transfigured humans that burst forth.

01:20:22.760 --> 01:20:24.960
(Polymorphic Soul Isomer) Again&nbsp;
utilizing Soul Multiplicity,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:20:24.960 --> 01:20:28.400
the user this time combines all of&nbsp;
his useless souls with weak rejection&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:20:28.400 --> 01:20:33.320
to create one body. This body is&nbsp;
called a Polymorphic Soul Isomer.

01:20:33.320 --> 01:20:38.360
A Polymorphic Soul Isomer is an attack based&nbsp;
transfiguration with extremely deadly force.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:20:38.360 --> 01:20:42.280
However, the trade-off for its crazy&nbsp;
strength is its lack of durability. A&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:20:42.280 --> 01:20:47.917
Polymorphic Soul Isomer can be killed with&nbsp;
a single direct hit using cursed energy.

01:20:47.917 --> 01:20:51.160
(Instant Spirit Body Of Distorted Killing) The&nbsp;
Instant Spirit Body of Distorted Killing is a&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:20:51.160 --> 01:20:57.000
special self-transfiguration that morphs the&nbsp;
user into a much more powerful state. Due to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:20:57.000 --> 01:21:00.920
the nature of Idle Transfiguration&nbsp;
and its connection to the soul,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:21:00.920 --> 01:21:05.280
Instant Spirit Body of Distorted Killing can&nbsp;
only be achieved when the user realizes the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:21:05.280 --> 01:21:10.680
truest essence of their being. This technique&nbsp;
not only greatly alters the user's appearance,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:21:10.680 --> 01:21:16.505
but increases their abilities, granting them&nbsp;
incredible offensive and defensive prowess.

01:21:16.505 --> 01:21:21.400
Cursed Naoya - Finally last on the list of every&nbsp;
cursed technique inside of Jujutsu Kaisen, we got&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:21:21.400 --> 01:21:28.052
the 1 Vengeful Cursed Spirit who has an ability&nbsp;
that isn't a domain expansion, Cursed Naoya.

01:21:28.052 --> 01:21:29.360
(Cursed Projection Sorcery)&nbsp;
As a vengeful cursed spirit&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:21:29.360 --> 01:21:37.160
Naoya somehow managed to retained his&nbsp;
innate technique. During his short time&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:21:37.160 --> 01:21:41.180
as a curse it was shown to be greatly&nbsp;
improved on by his cursed spirits body.

01:21:41.180 --> 01:21:44.760
(Acceleration Mode) An extension technique&nbsp;
he created as a cursed spirit Acceleration&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:21:44.760 --> 01:21:49.160
Mode allows a curse to bring in air through&nbsp;
the inlets they might have as they fly. One&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:21:49.160 --> 01:21:52.880
can then use the thrusting pressure and&nbsp;
their own cursed energy to eject the air&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:21:52.880 --> 01:21:57.000
out for an increased speed. This is a&nbsp;
very specific technique designed for&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:21:57.000 --> 01:22:01.560
the vengeful Naoya and I doubt anyone else&nbsp;
would ever be able to do something similar.

